3376	86d0f1d7-c02a-5487-9f48-111da438fe21	Photographer and documentary filmmaker\r<br/> <br/>Robert Baldridge has worked as a freelance photojournalist for over 40 years. His work has been published in the NYTimes , Vanity Fair, VOGUE , and by other magazines in Europe and South America . His work is in the vain of the concerned photography tradition.\r<br/>https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge\r<br/> <br/>Robert "Bob" Baldridge is a long-time Greenwich resident. For years he has used his camera to document his experiences, along with those of others. His work has appeared in Vogue, The New York Times Magazine and other publications abroad. He's especially drawn to recording the works-in-progress of other artists. He's documenting actor Matt Dillon's philanthropic work centered on a Rwandan doctor in Africa, and he's been documenting the Dalai Lama and his fellow Tibetans in exile in India.\r<br/> <br/>https://www.greenwichtime.com/news/article/Local-photographer-sheds-light-on-the-art-of-4768898.php#photo-5117574\r<br/>https://www.instagram.com/robertbaldridgeofficial/\r<br/>https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?modal=project-1467194\r<br/>https://gmpphoto.blogspot.com/2021/12/lisl-steiner-in-cerro-muriano-cordoba.html	1
