9	The concept of Civism is born from the French Revolution. We use it here is a universal sense, but with French heritage. We wish to be civic by example, promoting independence and transparency (accountability ultimately) from our own organization. Each of us may have different concepts of civism, and we all are legitimate in our own definitions.	2024-06-15 01:19:32.390806+02	2024-06-15 01:19:32.390829+02	1596	2	3301		manual	1		f
10	Plastic Arts	2024-06-15 01:19:45.658865+02	2024-06-15 01:19:45.658901+02	1599	2	3123		manual	1		f
11	Art is language and emotion. We use art to encourage cultural exchanges and individual well-being through transforming spaces into hybrid galleries. 	2024-06-15 01:20:55.916743+02	2024-06-15 01:20:55.9168+02	1600	2	3302		manual	1		f
12	Digital	2024-06-15 01:21:12.294929+02	2024-06-15 01:21:12.294962+02	1603	2	11		manual	1		f
13	Digital is normal, but is it human? We subscribe to the Contract for the Web and deploy our efforts in this way on three levels : (1) Social Computer Rooms (2) Google-Replacing Services and (3) Shared Computer Equipment and Expertise. Digital can isolate.	2024-06-15 01:23:33.109639+02	2024-06-15 01:23:33.109662+02	1604	2	3303		manual	1		f
