iles</a></p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"bjgac\\\\\\">Django-Village pour vos applications webs</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"etqij\\\\\\">site-exemple : <a href=\\\\\\"https://django.village.ngo\\\\\\">django.village.ngo</a><br/>d\\\\u00e9p\\\\u00f4t source : <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/chris2fr/django-village\\\\\\">github.com/chris2fr/django-village</a><br/>bifurqu\\\\u00e9 depuis <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr\\\\\\">github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr</a></p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"bg4ad\\\\\\">Fabrique-Village pour vos syst\\\\u00e8mes de design num\\\\u00e9riques</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"e3q5v\\\\\\">site-exemple : <a href=\\\\\\"https://django.village.ngo\\\\\\">django.village.ngo</a><br/>d\\\\u00e9p\\\\u00f4t source : <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/chris2fr/django-village\\\\\\">github.com/chris2fr/django-village</a><br/>bifurqu\\\\u00e9 depuis <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr\\\\\\">github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr</a></p>\\"}]", "header_with_title": false, "header_image": 62, "header_color_class": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "header_cta_text": "Voir l'entrep\\u00f4t des sources", "header_cta_label": "github.com/chris2fr/wagtail-village", "header_cta_link": "https://github.com/chris2fr/wagtail-village", "date": "2024-06-29T13:58:00Z", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "entry_tags": [], "blog_categories": [], "authors": []}	2024-07-14 11:12:06.839776+02	1	27c77d14-104e-4ba1-95e1-b4e80e1479d1	88	2024-07-14 11:12:06.838742+02	0005_alter_directoryentrypage_options_and_more
330	Le développement web	{"pk": 474, "path": "00010004000A000F", "depth": 4, "numchild": 1, "translation_key": "6a877505-415c-4b0f-80db-a23a55ab0932", "locale": 1, "latest_revision": 1798, "live": true, "has_unpublished_changes": false, "first_published_at": "2024-07-14T09:11:56.134Z", "last_published_at": "2024-07-14T11:49:53.418Z", "live_revision": 1798, "go_live_at": null, "expire_at": null, "expired": false, "locked": false, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "title": "Le d\\u00e9veloppement web", "draft_title": "Le d\\u00e9veloppement web", "slug": "build", "content_type": 89, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/apps/build/", "owner": 1, "seo_title": "", "show_in_menus": true, "search_description": "Voici des outils r\\u00e9galiens pour des sites citoyens issu de l'outillage qui utilise l'\\u00e9tat pour ses 20.000 domaines .gouv.fr. Vous pouvez cr\\u00e9er vos propres sites webs, son vos propres services, pour remplacer certains services Google et Wordpress  pour vous-m\\u00eames: un serveur pour tou.te.s et chacun.e !", "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-07-14T11:49:53.395Z", "alias_of": null, "body": "[{\\"id\\": \\"a80cf434-d0c4-43cf-bce7-24bd49690b3d\\", \\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"7jjj0\\\\\\">Outils r\\\\u00e9galiens pour des sites citoyens &amp; un serveur pour tous !</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1q4g4\\\\\\">Voici des outils r\\\\u00e9galiens pour des sites citoyens issu de l'outillage qui utilise l'\\\\u00e9tat pour ses 20.000 domaines .gouv.fr. Vous pouvez cr\\\\u00e9er vos propres sites webs, son vos propres services, pour remplacer certains services Google et Wordpress pour vous-m\\\\u00eames: un serveur pour tou.te.s et chacun.e !</p>\\"}, {\\"id\\": \\"0ba756f1-edfc-48ff-91e7-3a2bd67624b4\\", \\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"7jjj0\\\\\\">Wagtail-Fastoche pour vos cha\\\\u00eenes d'\\\\u00e9dition num\\\\u00e9riques</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"74md3\\\\\\">site-exemple : <a href=\\\\\\"https://wagtail.village.ngo\\\\\\">wagtail.village.ngo</a><br/>d\\\\u00e9p\\\\u00f4t source : <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/chris2fr/wagtail-village\\\\\\">github.com/chris2fr/wagtail-village</a><br/>bifurqu\\\\u00e9 depuis <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/nurmerique-gouv/sites-faciles\\\\\\">github.com/nurmerique-gouv/sites-faciles</a></p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"bgcv2\\\\\\">Django-Fastoche pour vos applications webs</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4pivt\\\\\\">site-exemple : <a href=\\\\\\"https://django.village.ngo\\\\\\">django.village.ngo</a><br/>d\\\\u00e9p\\\\u00f4t source : <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/chris2fr/django-village\\\\\\">github.com/chris2fr/django-village</a><br/>bifurqu\\\\u00e9 depuis <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr\\\\\\">github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr</a></p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"f8qe8\\\\\\">Fabrique-Fastoche pour vos syst\\\\u00e8mes de design num\\\\u00e9riques</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"c8g1s\\\\\\">site-exemple : <a href=\\\\\\"https://django.village.ngo\\\\\\">django.village.ngo</a><br/>d\\\\u00e9p\\\\u00f4t source : <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/chris2fr/django-village\\\\\\">github.com/chris2fr/django-village</a><br/>bifurqu\\\\u00e9 depuis <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr\\\\\\">github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr</a></p>\\"}]", "header_with_title": false, "header_image": null, "header_color_class": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "header_cta_text": null, "header_cta_label": null, "header_cta_link": null, "posts_per_page": 10, "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "contentpage_tags": [{"pk": 15, "tag": 36, "content_object": 474}]}	2024-07-14 11:12:06.757635+02	1	6a877505-415c-4b0f-80db-a23a55ab0932	89	2024-07-14 14:38:35.848561+02	0005_alter_directoryentrypage_options_and_more
332	Apps	{"pk": 436, "path": "00010004000A", "depth": 3, "numchild": 12, "translation_key": "a4dff79f-8e13-46e5-8185-c22ae76fb840", "locale": 1, "latest_revision": 1913, "live": true, "has_unpublished_changes": false, "first_published_at": "2024-07-14T09:11:53.431Z", "last_published_at": "2024-07-14T12:34:07.130Z", "live_revision": 1913, "go_live_at": null, "expire_at": null, "expired": false, "locked": false, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "title": "Apps", "draft_title": "Apps", "slug": "apps", "content_type": 25, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/apps/", "owner": 1, "seo_title": "", "show_in_menus": true, "search_description": "Voici les outils num\\u00e9riques disponibles pour toutes et pour tous. [\\u2026]", "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-07-14T12:34:07.103Z", "alias_of": null, "body": "[{\\"id\\": \\"256f3482-0e12-47c2-b60c-b084d329b70a\\", \\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ez6b5\\\\\\">Voici les outils num\\\\u00e9riques disponibles pour toutes et pour tous.</p>\\"}, {\\"id\\": \\"53eb7654-f566-4b57-93df-6848cbf70b47\\", \\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"org5t\\\\\\">Voici des points de d\\\\u00e9part pour les services num\\\\u00e9rique des Grands Voisins.</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"65u2u\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://homepage-dashboard.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Homepage-Dashboard</a> : le tableau de bord avec nos applications principales</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5tl3t\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://guichet.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Guichet (Login)</a> : G\\\\u00e9rer votre compte (guichet est un logiciel d\\\\u00e9velopp\\\\u00e9 par Les Grands Voisins)</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fph53\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://guichet.resdigita.com/user/new\\\\\\">Guichet (Inscription)</a> : Cr\\\\u00e9er votre compte</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7a6jj\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/numerique/\\\\\\">LesGrandsVoisins.fr/numerique</a> : La description de nos activit\\\\u00e9s num\\\\u00e9riques</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7j34f\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://quartz.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Quartz</a> : Consulter notre documentation sur les outils num\\\\u00e9riques (par exemple, configurer votre courriel)</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4ec4a\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://uptime-kuma.resdigita.com/status/gv\\\\\\">Uptime-Kuma</a> : V\\\\u00e9rifier l'\\\\u00e9tat de nos services</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5c9le\\\\\\">Voici des applications avec un login automatique :</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bsg2b\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://hedgedoc.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Hedgedoc</a> : Edition en temps r\\\\u00e9el de documents partag\\\\u00e9s</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4na3f\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://vikunja.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Vikunja</a> : Centraliser des informations sur des tous doux lisses</p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"2jajl\\\\\\">Voici <a href=\\\\\\"https://vaultwarden.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Vaultwarden</a> pour vos mots de passe :</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8ddmd\\\\\\">Le login et le mot de passe sont ind\\\\u00e9pendants et s\\\\u00e9curis\\\\u00e9s comme nous le pouvons.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"eelmc\\\\\\">Ce dispositif est compatible avec tous <a href=\\\\\\"https://bitwarden.com/fr-fr/download/\\\\\\">les clients BitWarden</a> (t\\\\u00e9l\\\\u00e9d\\\\u00e9chagement pour ios, Android, Windows, Linux et Apple). Mettez \\\\u00ab self-hosted \\\\u00bb ou \\\\u00ab auto-h\\\\u00e9berg\\\\u00e9 \\\\u00bb avec l'adresse https://vaultwarden.resdigita.com.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"duea9\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://vaultwarden.resdigita.com\\\\\\">https://vaultwarden.resdigita.com</a></p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"2od0g\\\\\\">Voici des services en lien avec le courriel</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1lkv5\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://mail.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Roundcube Webmail</a> : Acc\\\\u00e9der \\\\u00e0 vos mels par le web</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"851rt\\\\\\">Le courriel est cr\\\\u00e9\\\\u00e9 dans <a href=\\\\\\"https://guichet.resdigita.com/user\\\\\\">Guichet dans la partie \\\\u00ab modifier mon profil \\\\u00bb</a>. Chaque courriel que vous ajoutez sera un login distinct avec le m\\\\u00eame mot de passe que vous utilisez pour Guichet.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5cc41\\\\\\">La <a href=\\\\\\"https://quartz.resdigita.com/config/services/email\\\\\\">documentation dans Quartz</a> peut vous aider \\\\u00e0 la configuration de votre courriel (sur smartphone par exemple).</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"boude\\\\\\">La <a href=\\\\\\"https://guichet.resdigita.com/user/new\\\\\\">cr\\\\u00e9ation de compte sur Guichet</a> cr\\\\u00e9e automatiquement un courriel correspondant.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5n1sj\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://list.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">ListMonk</a> : Envois de Newsletters et gestions d'abonnements</p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"2758r\\\\\\">Voici des dispositifs d'administration web.</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"90kbh\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://wagtail.resdigita.com/admin/\\\\\\">Wagtail.Resdigita.Com</a> : Editer nos sites webs principaux</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dthba\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com/ghost/\\\\\\">blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com/ghost</a> : Editer notre blog</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5v6g\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://list.lesgrandsvoisins.com/\\\\\\">List Monk list</a> : Envoyer des newsletters</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fvqpc\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://uptime-kuma.resdigita.com/\\\\\\">Uptime Kuma admin</a> : Adminsitrer le tableau des statuts des services</p>\\"}]", "header_with_title": false, "header_image": 49, "header_color_class": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "header_cta_text": null, "header_cta_label": null, "header_cta_link": null, "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "contentpage_tags": []}	2024-07-14 14:31:52.85287+02	1	a4dff79f-8e13-46e5-8185-c22ae76fb840	25	2024-07-14 14:34:15.368199+02	0002_remove_formpage_page_ptr_delete_formfield_and_more
