20	000100070004000E	4	0	Thoughts about Creative Commons CC-BY-NC-SA (EN)	thoughts-about-creative-commons-cc-by-nc-sa-en	t	f	/gvcoop/blog/thoughts-about-creative-commons-cc-by-nc-sa-en/	Thoughts about Creative Commons CC-BY-NC-SA (EN)	t	Article about terms and conditions around storytelling incorporating photography as creative process including projection (not to say "publication") in the storytelling process.\n\nHow is a photographic artist to adapt to today's immaterial world. Art used to be material. Photos, even two-dimensional, used to be objects. There used to be edges. Now, everything is edgy. My goal here is to curate for the wellbeing of the world, but I fear that photograph of the orchestra on the glacier for a healthy and harmonious planet, mother Earth, is as endangered as the glacier itself, or at least the photographer and the musicians de par our own mortalities.	\N	\N	f	71	1	f	2024-05-05 20:09:56.445673+02	2024-05-05 20:09:56.473157+02	46	2024-05-05 20:09:56.473157+02	Thoughts about Creative Commons CC-BY-NC-SA (EN)	\N	\N	50049e8c-02e2-4981-a186-d65241a79bd3	1	\N	46
