ck-key=\\\\\\"hn4t\\\\\\">Fusionner <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">lesgrandsvoisins.com</a> en gv.coop</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2eb67\\\\\\">Remettre en place discourse.gv.coop</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"33t5g\\\\\\">Faire faire un logo Les Grands Voisins : GV.ccop</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"cn7ju\\\\\\">Mettre en place drive.gv.coop</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"48vlh\\\\\\">Faire contribution.gv.coop</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5td54\\\\\\">Blogging plateform GV.coop comme <a href=\\\\\\"https://blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com</a> ?</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"20qlr\\\\\\">Parcourrir le tableau de bord <a href=\\\\\\"https://homepage-dashboard.resdigita.com/\\\\\\">https://homepage-dashboard.resdigita.com/</a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"fu9l7\\\\\\">Page Home GV.coop</li></ol><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"77p8b\\\\\\">Choses inutiles finalement :</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"46a3\\\\\\">Impl\\\\u00e9menter PWM pour <a href=\\\\\\"http://ldap.gv.coop\\\\\\">ldap.gv.coop</a> EN ESSAI</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6bvrm\\\\\\">Impl\\\\u00e9menter une gestion d'utilisateurs et tableau de bord sur <a href=\\\\\\"https://login.gv.coop\\\\\\">login.gv.coop</a> EN ESSAI</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"05112cf4-8712-4be8-a8a3-d9f18d2a7862\\"}]", "section_2_body": "[]", "section_3_body": "[]", "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 2079, "translation_key": "9daa54a8-854b-4904-a0d5-246aa2a8eb78", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-10-22T08:48:48.743Z", "first_published_at": "2024-10-15T11:22:43.878Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "GV.coop Le nom de domaine gv.coop met en valeur notre statut d'association coopérative d'intérêt général. Au contraire des coopératives habituelles, […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-10-22T08:48:48.716Z", "sec