ons une constellation de serveurs et de services internet -- tableau de bord, cr\\\\u00e9ation et gestion de compte, courriel, rencontres hybrides pr\\\\u00e9sence-distance, listes de diffusion num\\\\u00e9riques, blogs, serveurs webs, gestionnaire de mot de passe, enregistrement dans le nuage, forums de discussion, gestion de la connaissance, \\\\u00e9dition markdown, wikis, \\\\u00e9dition bueautique, etc. -- pour, par, et de nous-m\\\\u00eames et d'autres.</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"ej6ca\\\\\\">Nous mettons \\\\u00e0 disposition des talents et des mat\\\\u00e9riaux dans des salles de sociabilit\\\\u00e9 num\\\\u00e9rique et dans des syst\\\\u00e8mes de pr\\\\u00eats et \\\\u00e9changes de mat\\\\u00e9riels \\\\u00e0 l'attention d'individus et d'organisations de tous niveaux.</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"apjqo\\\\\\">Voici quelques entit\\\\u00e9s Grandes Voisines qui soutiennent notre d\\\\u00e9marche: A Good Solution, Banya Tour, Robert Baldridge, BMCP, Breast Freedom, Le Bureau du Cr\\\\u00e9ateur, Le Chiffon, Les Jardins du Num\\\\u00e9rique, Olivier Duhec, Inno Cube, Caroline Lhomme, Francesco du 59 Rivoli, Amadou Gaye, Informatruck, Inolib, KaceKode, Ada Matus, L\\\\u2019Odys\\\\u00e9e, La Ressourcerie Cr\\\\u00e9ative, Henry Roy, Peter Vaeth, Waka Conseil, Weezem, et peut-\\\\u00eatre des v\\\\u00f4tres \\\\u2026</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"at7dp\\\\\\">Pour plus d\\\\u2019informations, contactez-nous\\\\u00a0: chris@lesgrandsvoisins.com +33 7 81 811 811</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"d3e4fb2e-7b28-4da0-99d3-09c2868a013f\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"video\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Les Grands Voisins, la cit\\\\u00e9 r\\\\u00eav\\\\u00e9e\\", \\"caption\\": \\"c 3, 2020 R\\\\u00e9alisation : Bastien Simon  Pitch : Ma\\\\u00ebl, artiste sans papier, Adrien, luthier musicien et d'autres r\\\\u00e9sidents venus de tous horizons, s'organisent pour donner naissance \\\\u00e0 une utopie moderne en plein coeur de Paris, un village solidaire de pr\\\\u00e8s de 2000 personnes : Les Grands Voisins. \\\\u00c0 travers leurs trajectoires et celles des membres fondateurs du lieu, le film interroge notre d\\\\u00e9sir et notre capacit\\\\u00e9 \\\\u00e0 inventer d\\\\u2019autres mani\\\\u00e8res de vivre ensemble. Que retiendrons-nous de cette exp\\\\u00e9rience collective ? Pourra-t-elle perdurer, essaimer, r\\\\u00e9sonner ailleurs ?\\", \\"url\\": \\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qZqErGfNF_o?feature=oembed\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"f53195d5-0de5-479d-aef1-6151fbd266e0\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "00010002", "slug": "home", "depth": 2, "owner": null, "title": "Bienvenue aux Grands Voisins", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 7, "url_path": "/home/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "L'association Les Grands Voisins", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Bienvenue aux Grands Voisins", "content_type": 25, "header_image": 7, "header_large": true, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": 76, "show_in_menus": true, "header_cta_link": "https://facile.lesgrandsvoisins.com/mission", "header_cta_text": "L'Autre est une chance !", "latest_revision": 76, "translation_key": "64c061ae-6a72-45e9-bb93-2e884f237976", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": "Lire la mission des Grands Voisins", "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": "2024-05-06T03:58:39.285Z", "first_published_at": "2024-05-05T07:42:47.708Z", "header_color_class": "blue-france", "search_description": "Nous, aux GV, nous œuvrons pour la compréhension entre peuples qui pourraient ne pas avoir tendance à communiquer habituellement. C'est le sens même de notre nom :\\r\\n\\r\\n« Les » comme les autres\\r\\n\\r\\n« Grands » comme les autres sont grands\\r\\n\\r\\n« Voisins » comme quoi les autres sont proches de nous, et nous sommes aussi des grands autres d'autres", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-05-06T03:58:39.258Z"}	\N	3	1	25	1	Bienvenue aux Grands Voisins
268	2024-06-01 16:52:57.51499+02	{"pk": 106, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"qeob9\\\\\\">Travail en cours</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"dfns2\\\\\\">Le Num\\\\u00e9rique des Voisins</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"e8amt\\\\\\">Nous offrons d\\\\u00e8s \\\\u00e0 pr\\\\u00e9sent:</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"9pf5c\\\\\\">Une base de logiciels libres \\\\u00e0 code source ouvert sur nos serveurs</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"76iem\\\\\\">Un Portail Apostrophe CMS (Potentiellement alternatif \\\\u00e0 Square Space)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"28ra7\\\\\\">Notre MTA public (Notre Poste Electronique Autonome)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"c1825\\\\\\">Listes de diffusion List Monk (alternatif \\\\u00e0 Mailchimp)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"ecahm\\\\\\">Syst\\\\u00e8me de Messages Discourse (Alternative \\\\u00e0 Slack et Reddit)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"4r08a\\\\\\">Jisti Meet (Alternatif \\\\u00e0 Zoom)</li></ol><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1gm11\\\\\\">et dans l\\\\u2019avenir proche:</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"fn25h\\\\\\">M\\\\u00e9dia Social Forem (Alternative \\\\u00e0 Facebook)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"810vk\\\\\\">Annuaire Les Grands Voisins (Les Voisins, leur comp\\\\u00e9tences, leurs offres)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"4rglc\\\\\\">Programme de fid\\\\u00e9lit\\\\u00e9 et cryptomonnaie</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"a031c\\\\\\">Multisite ApostropheCMS (Alternative to Squarespace)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5kjfb\\\\\\">Conseil en digital / num\\\\u00e9rique</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"9r1t8\\\\\\">Etc.</li></ol><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"8h8q2\\\\\\">Les Locaux des Voisins</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"39ea0\\\\\\">Nous offrons d\\\\u00e8s \\\\u00e0 pr\\\\u00e9sent:</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"49o21\\\\\\">Une rencontre mensuel dans notre espace popup</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"855jf\\\\\\">La rencontre de tous nos voisins dans leurs locaux et lors de leurs activit\\\\u00e9s</li></ol><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"e37i8\\\\\\">et dans l\\\\u2019avenir proche;</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"brhc9\\\\\\">Management and Promotion of Popup Spaces and Events</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5749o\\\\\\">A Loyalty Program for Participating Neighbors</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"95aue\\\\\\">Our own point of presence</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"3aev7\\\\\\">Expertise in hybrid diverse-community alternative spaces</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"cnh2a\\\\\\">Psycho-social risk management and employee empowerment</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"cbg5\\\\\\">Organizational consulting</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"tdbp\\\\\\">Etc.</li></ol><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"4coku\\\\\\">La Coop\\\\u00e9rative des Voisins</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4htru\\\\\\">Nous offrons d\\\\u00e8s \\\\u00e0 pr\\\\u00e9sent:</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"42ut2\\\\\\">Un processus d\\\\u2019acceuil de nouveaux Voisins</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2pas6\\\\\\">Une gouvernance participative / consultative</li></ol><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6hdbk\\\\\\">et dans l\\\\u2019avenir proche;</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"8jfqj\\\\\\">Des actions dans une coop\\\\u00e9rative</li></ol><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6654l\\\\\\">Et en anglais cela donne le suivant</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"e3ack\\\\\\">Services (EN)</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"9p7aa\\\\\\">Digital Neighbors</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"60jl\\\\\\">We currently offer a virtual FOSS space with ethics.</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"48neo\\\\\\">This Apostrophe CMS Portal (future alternative to Square Space)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"63c1q\\\\\\">A Public MTA (Our Electronic Post Office)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2j1dk\\\\\\">List Monk Mailing Lists (alternative to Mailchimp)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"bfmtt\\\\\\">Discourse Messaging (Alternative to Slack and Reddit)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2fosr\\\\\\">Jisti Meet (Alternative to Zoom)</li></ol><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"51nlh\\\\\\">and in the Near Future</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"9a12r\\\\\\">Forem Social Media (Alternative to Facebook)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5ko7l\\\\\\">Directory of Les Grands Voisins</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"4mqvn\\\\\\">Loyalty Program and Cryptomoney</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"cb80v\\\\\\">Multisite ApostropheCMS (Alternative to Squarespace)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"9u4tq\\\\\\">Digital Consulting</li></ol><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"73eo2\\\\\\">Local Neighbors</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5kifv\\\\\\">Currently we offer:</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"ch5mp\\\\\\">A Monthly Meeting in Our Popup Space</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"bfe9\\\\\\">Visiting Each of our Neighbors with a Physical Point of Presence</li></ol><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1vlu7\\\\\\">In the future, we hope to offer:</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"erq2\\\\\\">Management and Promotion of Popup Spaces and Events</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"blh91\\\\\\">A Loyalty Program for Participating Neighbors</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"44aoh\\\\\\">Our own point of presence</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"7rp8t\\\\\\">Expertise in hybrid diverse-community alternative spaces</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"16lce\\\\\\">Psycho-social risk management and employee empowerment</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"3i9oq\\\\\\">Organizational consulting</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"bgidh\\\\\\">Etc.</li></ol><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"7u7kn\\\\\\">Cooperative Neighbors</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9aja0\\\\\\">Currently we offer:</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"d7pj6\\\\\\">An on-boarding pre-neighbor membership</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"cjql5\\\\\\">Participation in our governance</li></ol><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1sul8\\\\\\">In the future, we would like to offer:</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"7uqe3\\\\\\">Shares in a cooperative</li></ol><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"b4bgj\\\\\\">---</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"21s87\\\\\\">Cette semaine, nous avons commenc\\\\u00e9 \\\\u00e0 r\\\\u00e9diger des informations sur <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.com/workingcopy?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">la page \\\\u00ab working copy \\\\u00bb du site Les Grands Voisins</a> sur les cat\\\\u00e9gories des services et l\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9quipe: deux sections alors manquantes sur notre page portail. Le concept pour l\\\\u2019instant est d\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9tablir des liens en num\\\\u00e9rique pour les concr\\\\u00e9tiser en pr\\\\u00e9sentiel. Pour cela, nous avons con\\\\u00e7u trois cat\\\\u00e9gories d\\\\u2019offres: le num\\\\u00e9rique, le pr\\\\u00e9sentiel, la coop\\\\u00e9rative. Nous avions surtout concentr\\\\u00e9 cette semaine nos efforts sur l\\\\u2019ESS, et avons aussi besoins d\\\\u2019incorporer le mixit\\\\u00e9 du grand public, des services sociaux et du pouvoir public.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"84e7e93b-07c5-4157-aa9b-0a11a9d5767d\\"}]", "date": "2021-08-26T10:00:00Z", "live": false, "path": "000100030003000L", "slug": "services-des-grands-voisins", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "Services des Grands Voisins", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [1], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/blog/services-des-grands-voisins/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Services des Grands Voisins", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 80, "header_large": true, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "665faeba-b4b1-43f6-8359-168ea04d97c9", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Travail en cours Le Numérique des Voisins Nous offrons dès à présent: Une base de logiciels libres à code source […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_c