274	2024-06-01 16:52:57.998415+02	{"pk": 109, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6h255\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://forum.lesgrandsvoisins.com/u/nazachri?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">@nazachri</a>, un sans papier refugi\\\\u00e9, a accept\\\\u00e9 l\\\\u2019invitation de <a href=\\\\\\"https://forum.lesgrandsvoisins.com/u/mannchri?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">@mannchri</a> et <a href=\\\\\\"https://forum.lesgrandsvoisins.com/u/poekels?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">@poekels</a> de participer dans les r\\\\u00e9unions de d\\\\u00e9marrage de Les Grands Voisins. C\\\\u2019est splendide !</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8vh07\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://forum.lesgrandsvoisins.com/u/nazachri?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">@nazachri</a> porte un int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat particulier pour la vocation des <a href=\\\\\\"https://mailing.lesgrandsvoisins.com/c/social/10?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">services sociaux</a> de Les Grands Voisins. Pour cela, <a href=\\\\\\"https://forum.lesgrandsvoisins.com/u/nazachri?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">@nazachri</a> s\\\\u2019accorde de participer dans les r\\\\u00e9unions de pilotage allant de toutes les semaines \\\\u00e0 tous les mois.</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"fnjsm\\\\\\">Candidat au directoire</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1r626\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://forum.lesgrandsvoisins.com/u/nazachri?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">@nazachri</a> , un sans papier refugi\\\\u00e9, est pr\\\\u00e9sent\\\\u00e9 au directoire et rencontra prochainement <a href=\\\\\\"https://forum.lesgrandsvoisins.com/u/poekels?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">@poekels</a> et <a href=\\\\\\"https://forum.lesgrandsvoisins.com/u/mannchri?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">@mannchri</a> en pr\\\\u00e9paration du fait d\\\\u2019acter sa venue lors d\\\\u2019une r\\\\u00e9union Zoom du mercredi 4 ao\\\\u00fbt \\\\u00e0 18h30. <a href=\\\\\\"https://forum.lesgrandsvoisins.com/u/nazachri?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">@nazachri</a> est un r\\\\u00e9fugi\\\\u00e9 tr\\\\u00e8s sensible \\\\u00e0 la France avec beaucoup \\\\u00e0 offrir.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"979adf4f-4fd1-4120-9287-4712ae03be5d\\"}]", "date": "2021-07-31T11:00:00Z", "live": false, "path": "000100030003000O", "slug": "candidat-au-directoire-des-grands-voisins", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "Candidat au Directoire des Grands Voisins", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [1], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/blog/candidat-au-directoire-des-grands-voisins/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Candidat au Directoire des Grands Voisins", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 83, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [3], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "d20d730d-ea68-43d9-8ead-1c328e57b6dc", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [{"pk": 57, "page": 109, "category": 3}], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "@nazachri , un sans papier refugié, a accepté l’invitation de @mannchri et @poekels de participer dans les réunions de démarrage […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-05-29T11:02:00.146Z"}	\N	109	\N	71	1	Candidat au Directoire des Grands Voisins
699	2024-06-20 15:47:57.213022+02	{"pk": 147, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"gqc5e\\\\\\">Denis Decastro</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"du74\\\\\\">Denis de Castro est un chercheur en m\\\\u00e9decine, qui travaillait auparavant, je crois, au CNRS, dans le centre de Paris. Denis vit maintenant \\\\u00e0 Dunedun, en Australie. Avant de prendre sa retraite, Denis traitait des donn\\\\u00e9es volumineuses en langage R et faisait des blagues, apportant de la lumi\\\\u00e8re \\\\u00e0 son \\\\u00e9quipe de recherche. Aujourd'hui, Denis est un contributeur important de Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"87bn5\\\\\\">Denis de Castro is a medical research scientist, previously I think with the CNRS in central Paris. Denis now lives in Dunedun Australia. Prior to retirement, Denis processed big data in R-languages and made jokes, bringing light to his research team. Today, Denis is a significant contributor to Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2e40h\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://auckland.academia.edu/DenisdeCastro?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Academia.edu</a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"32uv4\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.researchgate.net/scientific-contributions/Denis-de-Castro-33850121?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Researchgate</a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5qm44\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://flaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">flaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com</a><br/></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"8knt\\\\\\">Email</li></ul>\\", \\"id\\": \\"2b93b62d-b019-4a9b-a438-ba97546874d0\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:47:00Z", "live": true, "path": "0001000400050009", "slug": "bmcp-bio-medical-consulting-paris-also-aukland-and-dunedin", "depth": 4, "owner": 2, "title": "BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/bmcp-bio-medical-consulting-paris-also-aukland-and-dunedin/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 107, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": 633, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [3], "header_cta_link": "https://auckland.academia.edu/DenisdeCastro?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com", "header_cta_text": "Voir le site et l'appli", "latest_revision": 633, "translation_key": "4dc52cb9-7c1c-4a68-adf0-490f07a1e9fb", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [{"pk": 96, "page": 147, "category": 3}], "header_cta_label": "auckland.academia.edu", "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-06-19T14:56:08.701Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-18T13:48:45.030Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Denis Decastro\\r\\n\\r\\nDenis de Castro est un chercheur en médecine, qui travaillait auparavant, je crois, au CNRS, dans le centre de Paris. Denis vit maintenant à Dunedun, en Australie. Avant de prendre sa retraite, Denis traitait des données volumineuses en langage R et faisait des blagues, apportant de la lumière à son équipe de recherche. Aujourd'hui, Denis est un contributeur important de Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.\\r\\n\\r\\nDenis de Castro is a medical research scientist, previously I think with the CNRS in central Paris. Denis now lives in Dunedun Australia. Prior to retirement, Denis processed big data in R-languages and made jokes, bringing light to his research team. Today, Denis is a significant contributor to Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.\\r\\n\\r\\nAcademia.edu\\r\\nResearchgate\\r\\nflaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\r\\nEmail", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-19T14:56:08.680Z"}	\N	147	2	71	1	BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)
603	2024-06-19 16:50:58.881979+02	{"pk": 139, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"tvjjg\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.francemali.org\\\\\\">https://www.francemali.org</a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"drc4o\\\\\\">Nous somme une association de solidarit\\\\u00e9 et d'entraide, notre objectif est aid\\\\u00e9 les personnes dans le besoin, les villages en manque d'eau et de fournitures scolaire, dans le domaine de la sant\\\\u00e9, nous aidons les enfants abandonn\\\\u00e9s, les petites filles en difficult\\\\u00e9s etc..</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"9a4ba168-4b01-4656-b90e-efefe90c4c0f\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-17T16:52:00Z", "live": true, "path": "0001000400050001", "slug": "france-mali", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "France Mali", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/france-mali/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "associations", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "France Mali", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 98, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": 527, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [3], "header_cta_link": "https://www.francemali.org/", "header_cta_text": "Visiter le site", "latest_revision": 602, "translation_key": "1be7c9c3-bf83-4948-80f7-1138ca05f09d", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [{"pk": 73, "page": 139, "category": 3}], "header_cta_label": "francemali.org", "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": "2024-06-18T14:16:31.580Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-17T16:55:32.151Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Nous somme une association de solidarité et d'entraide, notre objectif est aidé les personnes dans le besoin, les villages en manque d'eau et de fournitures scolaire, dans le domaine de la santé, nous aidons les enfants abandonnés, les petites filles en difficultés etc..", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-19T14:50:56.737Z"}	\N	139	2	71	1	France Mali
325	2024-06-01 17:07:10.823087+02	{"pk": 131, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"callout\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"Venez co-constuire un voisinage anim\\\\u00e9, chic, vivant, partageant, \\\\u00e9quip\\\\u00e9, ressour\\\\u00e7ant, respectueux, mondial, multiculturel, prosp\\\\u00e8re, et de proximit\\\\u00e9.\\", \\"heading_tag\\": \\"h3\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"e7b35c91-a541-448a-bdca-fae320153771\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"tbuca\\\\\\">Nous sommes une association d'int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat g\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9ral agissant de mani\\\\u00e8re contr\\\\u00f4l\\\\u00e9e en subsidiarit\\\\u00e9 ouverte pour toute organisation et tout individu qui en fait la d\\\\u00e9cision pour soi-m\\\\u00eame principalement en ces trois domaines de Civisme, d'Arts plastiques et de Num\\\\u00e9rique selon notre d\\\\u00e9claration de mission.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"b314e733-eaaf-4100-886f-56834b3ab1b5\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "00010002000A", "slug": "association", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Association", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/association/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Association", "content_type": 25, "header_image": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": false, "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "f0d098f3-a7b7-49e7-b028-684bfd40f0e4", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "title text Venez co-constuire un voisinage animé, chic, vivant, partageant, équipé, ressourçant, respectueux, mondial, multiculturel, prospère, et de proximité. heading_tag […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes"