2018	2024-10-15 13:22:59.197174+02	{"pk": 533, "body": "[]", "live": true, "path": "00010008", "slug": "lesgv-les-grands-voisins", "depth": 2, "owner": 1, "title": "LesGV : Les Grands Voisins", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "sections": "[]", "url_path": "/lesgv-les-grands-voisins/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "LesGV : Les Grands Voisins", "content_type": 87, "header_image": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": false, "section_1_body": "[]", "section_2_body": "[]", "section_3_body": "[]", "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "59f43311-db24-4ba2-9bcf-bc022bf29220", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": null, "section_2_description_rich": ""}	\N	533	1	87	1	LesGV : Les Grands Voisins
289	2024-06-01 16:52:59.376757+02	{"pk": 116, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"eqnyo\\\\\\">Le 16 avril 2020 de 16h \\\\u00e0 17h30</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"42rn1\\\\\\">Pr\\\\u00e9sents:</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5jp5k\\\\\\">Sabine Arrondelle</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"fsppp\\\\\\">Michael Muszlak</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"3i9sf\\\\\\">Chris Mann</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"f2l6t\\\\\\">Gabriele Santini</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5isth\\\\\\">Madhi Mokhtari</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"98a7k\\\\\\">Juan Marcos</li></ul><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"8u1s2\\\\\\">Pr\\\\u00e9sentation de Juan Marcos</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"17kfk\\\\\\">Juan prend la parole. Une identit\\\\u00e9 est cr\\\\u00e9e dans les 5 ans d'existence des GV. Ca a pris vite avec des petites personnes, des petites structures.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"f56cm\\\\\\">Liens \\\\u00e0 favoriser entre les personnes qui ne se seraient pas .... (prs prencot\\\\u00e9es ???).</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"a0j4k\\\\\\">Monnaie-temps, tr\\\\u00e8s mal v\\\\u00e9\\\\u00e7ue. Cela a accentu\\\\u00e9 les in\\\\u00e9galit\\\\u00e9s.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6s68m\\\\\\">Des logiques n\\\\u00e9o-lib\\\\u00e9rales (aller permettre les meurs?)</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ci8ge\\\\\\">Oui puisant les petits murs trops petits.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"eg0fa\\\\\\">L'exp\\\\u00e9rience est bonne. Plus murs, sensibles. L'exp\\\\u00e9rience est plus ou moins r\\\\u00e9ussie.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bg62d\\\\\\">La raisonnance, becaoup de ma vie est l\\\\u00e0.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bnntt\\\\\\">La fin en septembre donne l'impression que cela ne va jamais ouvrir. Molorisqnte. Fin grande soir\\\\u00e9e. Aucune. Pas compl\\\\u00e8tement cotur\\\\u00e9 l'exp\\\\u00e9rience. R\\\\u00e9-actualiser.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fop47\\\\\\">Un site web? Cela peut avoir l'exp\\\\u00e9rience du pass\\\\u00e9, comme \\\\u00e0 Copenhague il y a 10 ans. Cela peut \\\\u00eatre comme Christiania, une enclave auto-g\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00e9e sans m\\\\u00e9moire de ce qui s'y \\\\u00e9tait pass\\\\u00e9 il y a 40 ans.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d3tvv\\\\\\">Pourrions-nous faire un gigantesque mosaique ? Enregistrer la m\\\\u00e9moire.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"14koa\\\\\\">Michel a pris la parole. Faut-il jeter les souvenirs? V\\\\u00e9ritable savoir qui a \\\\u00e9t\\\\u00e9 touch\\\\u00e9 par cette exp\\\\u00e9rience. Il y a un tri \\\\u00e9norme \\\\u00e0 faire.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"cbpgm\\\\\\">Il y a un travail de deuil. On n'aurait pas besoin ?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"v1dl\\\\\\">Crainte. Jamais qui d\\\\u00e9passer.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5kccj\\\\\\">Reproduction ?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"61ru\\\\\\">Jamais d\\\\u00e9passer.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5m1sc\\\\\\">Auto financer ...</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"c6nvv\\\\\\">Suite</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2p9fd\\\\\\">Cloturer</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1rej4\\\\\\">J'avoue se pr\\\\u00e9sente. Enseignant, agr\\\\u00e9\\\\u00e9 de philosophie.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"64mds\\\\\\">Amusant, moins ennuyant. probl\\\\u00e8mes de diversit\\\\u00e9.</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"3k6me\\\\\\">Gabriele se pr\\\\u00e9sente</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"95pq3\\\\\\">Gabriele a fait partie du mouvement \\\\u00e9tudiant en Italie. Ils ont gard\\\\u00e9 les murs.</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"cb18k\\\\\\">Michel se pr\\\\u00e9sente</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8arnt\\\\\\">Th\\\\u00e9orie de la diversit\\\\u00e9</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3v1qg\\\\\\">Aux individus appr\\\\u00e9hender le r\\\\u00e9el d'une autre mani\\\\u00e8re. Constructive de l'environnement.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"c2rka\\\\\\">Sensibilit\\\\u00e9 \\\\u00e0 la diversit\\\\u00e9 culturelle. Org qui paie pour la prestation.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"drgk4\\\\\\">Partage<br/>Intelligence mettre apprendre des uns des autres. Philo. Psychologie sociale.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dmfbv\\\\\\">Depuis un mois. En g\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9ral j'arrive.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9pmr9\\\\\\">Personnes vulnerables. Prises de convscience sur difficult\\\\u00e9.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fstbd\\\\\\">Codes d\\\\u00e9ontologiques. Th\\\\u00e9atre forme.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ml2q\\\\\\">Travailleur social.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6aj1t\\\\\\">Agir face \\\\u00e0 une r\\\\u00e9alit\\\\u00e9. Ateliers avec les \\\\u00e9tudiants. Jamais 15 id\\\\u00e9al. 8 \\\\u00e0 35 en r\\\\u00e9alit\\\\u00e9. Lib\\\\u00e9rer la parole. [Description de l'activit\\\\u00e9 de Juan].</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"f597h\\\\\\">Epaces</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"a6nns\\\\\\">Juan: On ne peut pas lire.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"do6a1\\\\\\">Michel: J'ai beaucoup lu sur Christinia. Faire une partie politique. Mauvaise image.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"46toc\\\\\\">Juan: Il existe virtuellement plus. Cloture.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bbdho\\\\\\">Volont\\\\u00e9. Mosaique virtuel.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ce7l4\\\\\\">F\\\\u00eate poste-confinement.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2efdk\\\\\\">Occasion de deuil. Enterrer lerus morts. Renaissance.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"a4c4o\\\\\\">F\\\\u00eate num\\\\u00e9rique ou digitale. Faire un site. Chemin r\\\\u00e9el, but.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bqf1k\\\\\\">Point de mir sur l'horizon.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"u5og\\\\\\">Ne peut pas \\\\u00eatre num\\\\u00e9rique. Guttenberg.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"11td7\\\\\\">Le service militaire est le vrai m\\\\u00e9lange social.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"83j81\\\\\\">F\\\\u00eate de l'enterrement des Grands Voisins. Monde hippi.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8mg8s\\\\\\">Parc de Vincennes. Hippodrome de Vincennes. Cartouch\\\\u00e9rie.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dudrb\\\\\\">Les gens maintenant 18 mois qui nous restent. Domaine virtuel. Ligne d'horizon.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d1ecl\\\\\\">Juan: Refl\\\\u00e9chir sur ces missions. Aide mosaique. Moaisque. Egoiste. Pas1 pe. Faire autrement. Evert en d\\\\u00e9veloppement.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6sgj4\\\\\\">Faire @ mels pour les contacter entretemps pour visa.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ah8ss\\\\\\">Web-documentaire.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"esa9a\\\\\\">We need to do something in between.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ao37j\\\\\\">Got to be fun to come here contils (?) ... -&gt;</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"19heu\\\\\\">Attestation -&gt; Open Source It</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9afqc\\\\\\">.fr -&gt; using the</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3m6nb\\\\\\">American besoin for exist.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4t515\\\\\\">Mosaic : everyone can put what they have.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"44pq4\\\\\\">CMS</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"a9sqr\\\\\\">Gabriele: autog\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00e9</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"alngs\\\\\\">Michel: I don't want to be boss.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bk1q2\\\\\\">Pesimistic autog\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00e9e. Secte.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fvop8\\\\\\">F\\\\u00e9d\\\\u00e9ration countries. local. Has power.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"f43nj\\\\\\">Espace Virtuel Autog\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00e9,</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6ipsi\\\\\\">Forum of content. Next cloud.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"epjv8\\\\\\">SCOP ?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"a5l7s\\\\\\">OS Contributor at night.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"eng8d\\\\\\">Sabine: Erire quelquechose au d\\\\u00e9part. Plien de comp\\\\u00e9tences.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"cjeb3\\\\\\">Michel: Ligne. Deuil. Groupe Acopolyapse. Enterrement et renaissance des GV comme esprit. Qu'est-ce qu'on fait d'ici l\\\\u00e0 ? F\\\\u00eates sur site. Op\\\\u00e9ra ... Collages photo espace perso ...</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1kfsa\\\\\\">Moments o\\\\u00f9 il y a \\\\u00e9normement de voisins.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6resv\\\\\\">GV Book le festif</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2a9k2\\\\\\">Sinon \\\\u00e7a n'existera pas. Rfl\\\\u00e9chir sur cette exp\\\\u00e9rience. Comp\\\\u00e9tences. Bilan avec explications de pourquoi \\\\u00e7a a d\\\\u00e9conn\\\\u00e9 selon nous. D'autres exp\\\\u00e9riences. Interroger d'autres acters. Faire ce que...Tirer un ... semer.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"apa3t\\\\\\">Sabine : Fin repouss\\\\u00e9e de deux mois ou plus. Donner un nouveau d\\\\u00e9but. Trobinoscope g\\\\u00e9ant.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ar09s\\\\\\">Outil : verser des textes. Photos. M\\\\u00e9morial. Mosaic.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"66epa\\\\\\">Yann Artus-Bertrand photos et filmes. Diversit\\\\u00e9 des th\\\\u00e8mes. Avis de chacun. 1 truc pareil. 1 question \\\\u00e0 plein d'acteurs des GV, \\\\u00e0 plein de visiteurs des GV.</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"adiqa\\\\\\">Deuil et renaissance</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"dbeca\\\\\\">Diversit\\\\u00e9</li></ol><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1qmd4\\\\\\">I feel guilty doing nothing. Send you the link to Michel.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"19ho9\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"c6prt\\\\\\"><a id=\\\\\\"2\\\\\\" linktype=\\\\\\"document\\\\\\">meet-2020-04-08-to2020-04-18-les_grands_voisins</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"50836c01-b2d2-43ae-b20b-fa53215115fd\\"}]", "date": "2020-04-16T11:08:00Z", "live": false, "path": "000100030003000V", "slug": "3e-conseil-des-voisins", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "3e Conseil des Voisins", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [1], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/blog/3e-conseil-des-voisins/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "3e Conseil des Voisins", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 90, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 288, "translation_key": "55e28917-1960-42a2-9591-796da5d4a995", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Le 16 avril 2020 de 16h à 17h30 Présents: Sabine Arrondelle Michael Muszlak Chris Mann Gabriele Santini Madhi Mokhtari Juan […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-01T14:52:59.320Z"}	\N	116	1	71	1	3e Conseil des Voisins
290	2024-06-01 16:52:59.724112+02	{"pk": 117, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ky42f\\\\\\">Le 3 avril 2020 ou 2020 \\\\u00e0 Paris de 11:00 \\\\u00e0 12:30</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"detkf\\\\\\">Present:</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"b5uro\\\\\\">Sabine Arrondelle</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"39tp4\\\\\\">Michael Muszlak</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"emagk\\\\\\">Chris Mann</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"9n4ks\\\\\\">Gabriele Santini</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"c7a31\\\\\\">...</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fqmvv\\\\\\">The departure of the Grands Voisins will be postponed.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d42ur\\\\\\">Rehabilitation on \\\\\\"Le Village des Grands Voisins\\\\\\". The purpose of this effort was to involve the residents (marginalized people who need shelter and food) more. Some would have seen this as a personal attack, a desire to take power, to reject the other. This ended with the inner circle of the Big Neighbours \\\\\\"management\\\\\\" declaring (\\\\\\"we don't want to work with you\\\\\\").</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fq59v\\\\\\">We lack the will to work together. We are convinced that yes, we have a will to work together. Then, now, it works better, for example with the DIY workshop. This is what we wanted to do in the beginning in 2014, what we wanted to do.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9eplh\\\\\\">Gabriele</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9rkuh\\\\\\">Is it about leaving it just in our memories or is it about making it or evolving it in a different direction?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"edt4f\\\\\\">Gabriele presents himself with his company smart-team.tn. Gabriele participated in the student movement of the 90's in Italy by constant the energy of groups, sub-groups, etc. in an interdisciplinary project of two years. At some point the question of choices arose, what to do?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fuk6l\\\\\\">Here, Gabriele would like to bring something to the table. Gabriele loves the energy that makes Great Neighbours.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"b4usv\\\\\\">Sabine</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fnpsp\\\\\\">Sabine presents the creative recycling shop. The surplus of some can be given to others and we fight against waste. Many have the same sensibility.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"966qv\\\\\\">The experience was sometimes painful, not living up to the hopes and dreams.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ere3h\\\\\\">Agenda</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"56akk\\\\\\">Think</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7vubd\\\\\\">What caused it not to fill?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dlq9r\\\\\\">What did you have to do to make it better?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9cbok\\\\\\">How do we go about it for the next experiment? (governance, democracy)</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d64s\\\\\\">The rides are beautiful, but the backstage areas are less glorious.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ekfrs\\\\\\">Why some people don't like me enough</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bgh8i\\\\\\">Fears ...</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5r6ue\\\\\\">Michel</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1qh49\\\\\\">What is this dream that has been dashed.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ajojp\\\\\\">Phase 1 not thought about disps loem</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bqvma\\\\\\">We wanted to live together</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"74bnm\\\\\\">We didn't think about it because the City Council gave certain powers etc.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"cling\\\\\\">Phase 2</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"290u1\\\\\\">Reflecting, setting up phase 1, proposing circles. Didn't work. Those who were given power by City Hall did not want to share power.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"54qc9\\\\\\">More experimentation. Let's come up with something different together.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"e5141\\\\\\">Sabine</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"a58bd\\\\\\">Succeed in making / in common.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dqjb9\\\\\\">Many very motivated people transform the lives of the residents</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"579u\\\\\\">have not chosen to go through social services to be housed.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7j83l\\\\\\">The same in the center max activities around. does a lot of things matter. Be eager to do, to share.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fvunt\\\\\\">Phase 2</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2sc27\\\\\\">Less space</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"99jpg\\\\\\">Economic will</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"e08o2\\\\\\">this kind</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"59fvu\\\\\\">project has been abandoned</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"cjadc\\\\\\">Time to spare</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"19nml\\\\\\">we missed the thing</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6q1ir\\\\\\">Why did we miss it?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"96lgt\\\\\\">We have time. That was extra.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6k87n\\\\\\">All the associations have left the bridle. It happens to be near the end.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"c4jdu\\\\\\">It's been working for a few months, since the beginning of the school year. A power that is not shared by all, decisions that have fallen on their heads.<br/>Start right away with other means.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"avgeq\\\\\\">Gabriele</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ae4v3\\\\\\">Other spaces that open up ?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"a0jc1\\\\\\">Sabine</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"150gc\\\\\\">Is what we express appropriate for others?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"b9eo2\\\\\\">Why did some people accept?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6ipo3\\\\\\">I think of the artists. The people in reunios that have made his trust totally to the associations.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dtomu\\\\\\">Power grab to the max.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"24ob9\\\\\\">This is not acceptable.<br/>It's not what I want.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5cip3\\\\\\">Most of them accepted</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"1ng4e\\\\\\">playing the game</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"65h4s\\\\\\">by withdrawing</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1fg2i\\\\\\">abandoning the common project. Frustrated that they were left with the crumbs.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"23jqk\\\\\\">Michel</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8h2jl\\\\\\">No common project. 1 empty.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"83kh6\\\\\\">Many artists' collectives.</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"35sq0\\\\\\">1 open space</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"4m2ht\\\\\\">1 small structuring</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"f17q9\\\\\\">1 end of the story</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3ql8f\\\\\\">History of squatters, \\\\\\"legitimate\\\\\\" owner.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dfeci\\\\\\">Associations that work. Three major associations.</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"cekcg\\\\\\">1</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"3jkdo\\\\\\">2</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"1s6rr\\\\\\">3</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"eim7t\\\\\\">Coulouche</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8uo6i\\\\\\">Open field, no need for a goal.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5mn6g\\\\\\">Aggregate 1 association. We need a goal, a direction: an ideology.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"51s3h\\\\\\">Gaudi</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bb4sj\\\\\\">There must be a specific goal.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ao0hm\\\\\\">Sabine</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"80i1t\\\\\\">To do what, for what purpose?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"84uc1\\\\\\">Share our contact information.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2rjgg\\\\\\">Gabriele</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5lrc1\\\\\\">Creating emptiness can be a key or a goal.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2ph3s\\\\\\">Michel</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"a20rl\\\\\\">Phalaustere Fourrier</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"cg43c\\\\\\">Half circle: single, monk, habit, ...</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1kota\\\\\\">The whole life builds an object. Pre-Marxist. There is a way to live.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"89f2u\\\\\\">Gabriele</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4i827\\\\\\">Non-Comnery Centre</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"nbsd\\\\\\">Michel</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8bgmd\\\\\\">Unifying idea</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"21puf\\\\\\">Panel</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"feel\\\\\\">No land behind</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d5dgj\\\\\\">Ideology.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fvdfm\\\\\\">Social life of everyone</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d9uod\\\\\\">Chris</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2klj6\\\\\\">Sabine</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"b0f5q\\\\\\">Thank you, it's very interesting I think. We are not</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2ffj2\\\\\\">I'm in. Participant to join us. Receiving social assistance.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9pcdc\\\\\\">Reflecting people who have lived.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dp6f2\\\\\\">Michel</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4bjl2\\\\\\">Goal</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8sl1q\\\\\\">Fight for governance tendency to want more ... power etc. etc.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bgapi\\\\\\"><a linktype=\\\\\\"document\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\"3\\\\\\">scan-2020-04-03-lesgrandsvoisinsfr</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"33a7191d-d2a5-4168-8f99-56c864bc91c6\\"}]", "date": "2020-04-03T11:09:00Z", "live": false, "path": "000100030003000W", "slug": "2e-conseil-des-voisins", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "2e Conseil des Voisins", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [1], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/blog/2e-conseil-des-voisins/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "2e Conseil des Voisins", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 91, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "86122aab-e35e-4514-b076-6a37c4bfc428", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Le 3 avril 2020 ou 2020 à Paris de 11:00 à 12:30 Present: Sabine Arrondelle Michael Muszlak Chris Mann Gabriele […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-05-29T11:12:02.635Z"}	\N	117	\N	71	1	2e Conseil des Voisins
291	2024-06-01 16:52:59.783025+02	{"pk": 117, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ky42f\\\\\\">Le 3 avril 2020 ou 2020 \\\\u00e0 Paris de 11:00 \\\\u00e0 12:30</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"detkf\\\\\\">Present:</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"b5uro\\\\\\">Sabine Arrondelle</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"39tp4\\\\\\">Michael Muszlak</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"emagk\\\\\\">Chris Mann</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"9n4ks\\\\\\">Gabriele Santini</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"c7a31\\\\\\">...</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fqmvv\\\\\\">The departure of the Grands Voisins will be postponed.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d42ur\\\\\\">Rehabilitation on \\\\\\"Le Village des Grands Voisins\\\\\\". The purpose of this effort was to involve the residents (marginalized people who need shelter and food) more. Some would have seen this as a personal attack, a desire to take power, to reject the other. This ended with the inner circle of the Big Neighbours \\\\\\"management\\\\\\" declaring (\\\\\\"we don't want to work with you\\\\\\").</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fq59v\\\\\\">We lack the will to work together. We are convinced that yes, we have a will to work together. Then, now, it works better, for example with the DIY workshop. This is what we wanted to do in the beginning in 2014, what we wanted to do.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9eplh\\\\\\">Gabriele</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9rkuh\\\\\\">Is it about leaving it just in our memories or is it about making it or evolving it in a different direction?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"edt4f\\\\\\">Gabriele presents himself with his company smart-team.tn. Gabriele participated in the student movement of the 90's in Italy by constant the energy of groups, sub-groups, etc. in an interdisciplinary project of two years. At some point the question of choices arose, what to do?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fuk6l\\\\\\">Here, Gabriele would like to bring something to the table. Gabriele loves the energy that makes Great Neighbours.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"b4usv\\\\\\">Sabine</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fnpsp\\\\\\">Sabine presents the creative recycling shop. The surplus of some can be given to others and we fight against waste. Many have the same sensibility.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"966qv\\\\\\">The experience was sometimes painful, not living up to the hopes and dreams.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ere3h\\\\\\">Agenda</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"56akk\\\\\\">Think</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7vubd\\\\\\">What caused it not to fill?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dlq9r\\\\\\">What did you have to do to make it better?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9cbok\\\\\\">How do we go about it for the next experiment? (governance, democracy)</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d64s\\\\\\">The rides are beautiful, but the backstage areas are less glorious.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ekfrs\\\\\\">Why some people don't like me enough</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bgh8i\\\\\\">Fears ...</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5r6ue\\\\\\">Michel</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1qh49\\\\\\">What is this dream that has been dashed.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ajojp\\\\\\">Phase 1 not thought about disps loem</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bqvma\\\\\\">We wanted to live together</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"74bnm\\\\\\">We didn't think about it because the City Council gave certain powers etc.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"cling\\\\\\">Phase 2</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"290u1\\\\\\">Reflecting, setting up phase 1, proposing circles. Didn't work. Those who were given power by City Hall did not want to share power.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"54qc9\\\\\\">More experimentation. Let's come up with something different together.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"e5141\\\\\\">Sabine</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"a58bd\\\\\\">Succeed in making / in common.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dqjb9\\\\\\">Many very motivated people transform the lives of the residents</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"579u\\\\\\">have not chosen to go through social services to be housed.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7j83l\\\\\\">The same in the center max activities around. does a lot of things matter. Be eager to do, to share.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fvunt\\\\\\">Phase 2</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2sc27\\\\\\">Less space</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"99jpg\\\\\\">Economic will</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"e08o2\\\\\\">this kind</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"59fvu\\\\\\">project has been abandoned</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"cjadc\\\\\\">Time to spare</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"19nml\\\\\\">we missed the thing</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6q1ir\\\\\\">Why did we miss it?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"96lgt\\\\\\">We have time. That was extra.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6k87n\\\\\\">All the associations have left the bridle. It happens to be near the end.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"c4jdu\\\\\\">It's been working for a few months, since the beginning of the school year. A power that is not shared by all, decisions that have fallen on their heads.<br/>Start right away with other means.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"avgeq\\\\\\">Gabriele</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ae4v3\\\\\\">Other spaces that open up ?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"a0jc1\\\\\\">Sabine</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"150gc\\\\\\">Is what we express appropriate for others?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"b9eo2\\\\\\">Why did some people accept?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6ipo3\\\\\\">I think of the artists. The people in reunios that have made his trust totally to the associations.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dtomu\\\\\\">Power grab to the max.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"24ob9\\\\\\">This is not acceptable.<br/>It's not what I want.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5cip3\\\\\\">Most of them accepted</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"1ng4e\\\\\\">playing the game</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"65h4s\\\\\\">by withdrawing</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1fg2i\\\\\\">abandoning the common project. Frustrated that they were left with the crumbs.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"23jqk\\\\\\">Michel</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8h2jl\\\\\\">No common project. 1 empty.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"83kh6\\\\\\">Many artists' collectives.</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"35sq0\\\\\\">1 open space</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"4m2ht\\\\\\">1 small structuring</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"f17q9\\\\\\">1 end of the story</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3ql8f\\\\\\">History of squatters, \\\\\\"legitimate\\\\\\" owner.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dfeci\\\\\\">Associations that work. Three major associations.</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"cekcg\\\\\\">1</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"3jkdo\\\\\\">2</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"1s6rr\\\\\\">3</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"eim7t\\\\\\">Coulouche</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8uo6i\\\\\\">Open field, no need for a goal.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5mn6g\\\\\\">Aggregate 1 association. We need a goal, a direction: an ideology.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"51s3h\\\\\\">Gaudi</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bb4sj\\\\\\">There must be a specific goal.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ao0hm\\\\\\">Sabine</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"80i1t\\\\\\">To do what, for what purpose?</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"84uc1\\\\\\">Share our contact information.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2rjgg\\\\\\">Gabriele</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5lrc1\\\\\\">Creating emptiness can be a key or a goal.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2ph3s\\\\\\">Michel</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"a20rl\\\\\\">Phalaustere Fourrier</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"cg43c\\\\\\">Half circle: single, monk, habit, ...</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1kota\\\\\\">The whole life builds an object. Pre-Marxist. There is a way to live.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"89f2u\\\\\\">Gabriele</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4i827\\\\\\">Non-Comnery Centre</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"nbsd\\\\\\">Michel</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8bgmd\\\\\\">Unifying idea</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"21puf\\\\\\">Panel</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"feel\\\\\\">No land behind</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d5dgj\\\\\\">Ideology.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fvdfm\\\\\\">Social life of everyone</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d9uod\\\\\\">Chris</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2klj6\\\\\\">Sabine</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"b0f5q\\\\\\">Thank you, it's very interesting I think. We are not</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2ffj2\\\\\\">I'm in. Participant to join us. Receiving social assistance.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9pcdc\\\\\\">Reflecting people who have lived.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dp6f2\\\\\\">Michel</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4bjl2\\\\\\">Goal</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8sl1q\\\\\\">Fight for governance tendency to want more ... power etc. etc.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bgapi\\\\\\"><a id=\\\\\\"3\\\\\\" linktype=\\\\\\"document\\\\\\">scan-2020-04-03-lesgrandsvoisinsfr</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"33a7191d-d2a5-4168-8f99-56c864bc91c6\\"}]", "date": "2020-04-03T11:09:00Z", "live": false, "path": "000100030003000W", "slug": "2e-conseil-des-voisins", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "2e Conseil des Voisins", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [1], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/blog/2e-conseil-des-voisins/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "2e Conseil des Voisins", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 91, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 290, "translation_key": "86122aab-e35e-4514-b076-6a37c4bfc428", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Le 3 avril 2020 ou 2020 à Paris de 11:00 à 12:30 Present: Sabine Arrondelle Michael Muszlak Chris Mann Gabriele […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-01T14:52:59.724Z"}	\N	117	1	71	1	2e Conseil des Voisins
292	2024-06-01 16:52:59.880951+02	{"pk": 118, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6wxgl\\\\\\">Ci-dessous est une \\\\u00e9change que j\\\\u2019ai eu sur Facebook avec le Pr\\\\u00e9sident d\\\\u2019Aurore, Eric Pilez, au sujet des Grands Voisins.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1i4o8\\\\\\">Eric Pliez: On peut exporter notre ing\\\\u00e9nierie GV si besoin !<br/><br/>Chris Mann: M\\\\u00eames questions pour vous Eric. quels acteurs sont \\\\u00ab l\\\\u00e9gltimes? \\\\u00bb Quelles places pour l\\\\u2019inclusion et pour l\\\\u2019excluslon dans de tels efforts? Quels acteurs inattendus pouvons-nous attendre (la question n\\\\u2019est pas \\\\u00e9vidente)? Estee un nouveau m\\\\u00e9tier ?<br/><br/>Eric Pliez Chris Mann je dirai hybridation culturelle et de m\\\\u00e9tier La r\\\\u00e9ussite repose sur la dynamique du groupe dont chacun apporte son savoir faire dans une id\\\\u00e9e de partage Paris nous avons un copil r\\\\u00e9gulier avec la mairie. L\\\\u2019autre principe repose sur une ouverture sur l\\\\u2019exterieur Pascale connait tout \\\\u00e7a mieux que moi !</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9glad\\\\\\">Je peux commenter l\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9change \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019occaison.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"buaf0\\\\\\">Nous nous cherchons toujours comment parler de ces Grands Voisins et d\\\\u2019autres Grands Voisins sur le site .org. Suffit-il de dire que nous sommes des propositions diff\\\\u00e9rentes sans association entre nous ? Moi, Chris, ai compos\\\\u00e9 la Charte des Grands Voisins de 2017 \\\\u00e0 partir de contributions d\\\\u2019une centaine de personnes sur un p\\\\u00e9riode d\\\\u2019un mois au sein du projet \\\\u00e0 Saint Vincent de Paul \\\\u00e0 Paris en novembre 2017. Notre h\\\\u00e9ritage commun s\\\\u2019arr\\\\u00eate \\\\u00e0 peu pr\\\\u00e8s l\\\\u00e0.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1iunu\\\\\\">Je voulais d\\\\u2019abord lire autobiographie d\\\\u2019Annette Monod avant de les envoyer. Ca y est, les livres sont envoy\\\\u00e9s avec un peu de retard.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"dadc916e-d97b-40f9-876b-74e5ecf4f529\\"}]", "date": "2018-09-01T11:12:00Z", "live": false, "path": "000100030003000X", "slug": "qui-est-expert-etou-légitime", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "Qui est expert et/ou légitime", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [1], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/blog/qui-est-expert-etou-légitime/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Qui est expert et/ou légitime", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 92, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "aa3d0786-beca-46e5-9ef7-8bcf93348f23", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Ci-dessous est une échange que j’ai eu sur Facebook avec le Président d’Aurore, Eric Pilez, au sujet des Grands Voisins. […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-05-29T11:13:22.362Z"}	\N	118	\N	71	1	Qui est expert et/ou légitime
293	2024-06-01 16:52:59.923033+02	{"pk": 118, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6wxgl\\\\\\">Ci-dessous est une \\\\u00e9change que j\\\\u2019ai eu sur Facebook avec le Pr\\\\u00e9sident d\\\\u2019Aurore, Eric Pilez, au sujet des Grands Voisins.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1i4o8\\\\\\">Eric Pliez: On peut exporter notre ing\\\\u00e9nierie GV si besoin !<br/><br/>Chris Mann: M\\\\u00eames questions pour vous Eric. quels acteurs sont \\\\u00ab l\\\\u00e9gltimes? \\\\u00bb Quelles places pour l\\\\u2019inclusion et pour l\\\\u2019excluslon dans de tels efforts? Quels acteurs inattendus pouvons-nous attendre (la question n\\\\u2019est pas \\\\u00e9vidente)? Estee un nouveau m\\\\u00e9tier ?<br/><br/>Eric Pliez Chris Mann je dirai hybridation culturelle et de m\\\\u00e9tier La r\\\\u00e9ussite repose sur la dynamique du groupe dont chacun apporte son savoir faire dans une id\\\\u00e9e de partage Paris nous avons un copil r\\\\u00e9gulier avec la mairie. L\\\\u2019autre principe repose sur une ouverture sur l\\\\u2019exterieur Pascale connait tout \\\\u00e7a mieux que moi !</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9glad\\\\\\">Je peux commenter l\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9change \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019occaison.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"buaf0\\\\\\">Nous nous cherchons toujours comment parler de ces Grands Voisins et d\\\\u2019autres Grands Voisins sur le site .org. Suffit-il de dire que nous sommes des propositions diff\\\\u00e9rentes sans association entre nous ? Moi, Chris, ai compos\\\\u00e9 la Charte des Grands Voisins de 2017 \\\\u00e0 partir de contributions d\\\\u2019une centaine de personnes sur un p\\\\u00e9riode d\\\\u2019un mois au sein du projet \\\\u00e0 Saint Vincent de Paul \\\\u00e0 Paris en novembre 2017. Notre h\\\\u00e9ritage commun s\\\\u2019arr\\\\u00eate \\\\u00e0 peu pr\\\\u00e8s l\\\\u00e0.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1iunu\\\\\\">Je voulais d\\\\u2019abord lire autobiographie d\\\\u2019Annette Monod avant de les envoyer. Ca y est, les livres sont envoy\\\\u00e9s avec un peu de retard.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"dadc916e-d97b-40f9-876b-74e5ecf4f529\\"}]", "date": "2018-09-01T11:12:00Z", "live": false, "path": "000100030003000X", "slug": "qui-est-expert-etou-legitime", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "Qui est expert et/ou légitime", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [1], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/blog/qui-est-expert-etou-legitime/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Qui est expert et/ou légitime", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 92, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 292, "translation_key": "aa3d0786-beca-46e5-9ef7-8bcf93348f23", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Ci-dessous est une échange que j’ai eu sur Facebook avec le Président d’Aurore, Eric Pilez, au sujet des Grands Voisins. […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-01T14:52:59.880Z"}	\N	118	1	71	1	Qui est expert et/ou légitime
294	2024-06-01 16:53:00.0439+02	{"pk": 119, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"vkpwc\\\\\\">\\\\ud83c\\\\udf1f D\\\\u00e9couvrez le 22\\\\u00e8me Conseil des Grands Voisins ! \\\\ud83c\\\\udf1f</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"976vi\\\\\\">Nous avons le plaisir de vous inviter \\\\u00e0 participer au 22\\\\u00e8me Conseil des Grands Voisins, une rencontre incontournable pour tous ceux qui souhaitent s'investir dans la coordination et le d\\\\u00e9veloppement des initiatives sociales, \\\\u00e9conomiques et artistiques. Cet \\\\u00e9v\\\\u00e9nement est l'occasion parfaite pour \\\\u00e9changer, collaborer et innover ensemble.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"apvbk\\\\\\">Nous tiendrions le 22e Conseil des Voisins sur trois rencontres dans le 14e arrondissement \\\\u00e0 Paris et en ligne :</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"cih95\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/les-grands-voisins/evenements/les-grands-voisins\\\\\\"><b>Lundi 10 juin 19:45 - 21:15</b></a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"esut3\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/les-grands-voisins/evenements/les-grands-voisins-1\\\\\\"><b>Jeudi 13 juin 15:15 - 16h45</b></a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dcnrb\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/les-grands-voisins/evenements/les-grands-voisins-2\\\\\\"><b>Lundi 10 juin 19:45 - 21:15</b></a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8t91j\\\\\\">Notre association, les Grands Voisins, \\\\u0153uvre depuis plusieurs ann\\\\u00e9es \\\\u00e0 cr\\\\u00e9er des ponts entre les diff\\\\u00e9rents acteurs de la soci\\\\u00e9t\\\\u00e9, afin de b\\\\u00e2tir une communaut\\\\u00e9 solidaire et dynamique. Lors de cette journ\\\\u00e9e ou soir\\\\u00e9e, vous aurez l'opportunit\\\\u00e9 de rencontrer des personnes inspirantes, de d\\\\u00e9couvrir des projets novateurs et de participer \\\\u00e0 des ateliers interactifs.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"abnv3\\\\\\">Rejoignez-nous soit le lundi 10 juin 2024 \\\\u00e0 19:45 ou le jeudi 13 juin \\\\u00e0 15:15 ou le samedi 15 juin \\\\u00e0 10:15 ! dans le 14e (proximit\\\\u00e9 m\\\\u00e9tro Al\\\\u00e9sia) pour une journ\\\\u00e9e ou soir\\\\u00e9e riche en \\\\u00e9changes et en cr\\\\u00e9ativit\\\\u00e9. Ensemble, construisons un avenir plus humain et plus cr\\\\u00e9atif !</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"jlk4\\\\\\">#LesGrandsVoisins #Num\\\\u00e9rique #ArtsPlastiques #Civisme</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ctqq0\\\\\\">Chris Mann . 27 mai. 2024</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"61744e7e-705c-48f9-872a-f3428c2db521\\"}]", "date": "2024-05-27T11:14:00Z", "live": false, "path": "000100030003000Y", "slug": "22e-conseil-des-grands-voisins", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "22e Conseil des Grands Voisins", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [1], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/blog/22e-conseil-des-grands-voisins/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "22e Conseil des Grands Voisins", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 93, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [3], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "015a3d72-44f5-44dd-b939-861879f88ef3", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [{"pk": 59, "page": 119, "category": 3}], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "🌟 Découvrez le 22ème Conseil des Grands Voisins ! 🌟 Nous avons le plaisir de vous inviter à participer au […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-05-29T11:16:37.291Z"}	\N	119	\N	71	1	22e Conseil des Grands Voisins
