h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"33a8d\\\\\\"><b>Des structures et collectifs</b></h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"30oc5\\\\\\">Les structures sont les canaux d\\\\u2019action \\\\u00e0 travers l\\\\u2019association coop\\\\u00e9rative d\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat public. Les structures peuvent \\\\u00eatre des associations, des entreprises, des professionnels, des artistes, des artisans, des collectifs, des services sociaux, ou des institutions publiques. Nous souhaitons fournir un soutien aux structures selon le principe de subsidiarit\\\\u00e9 et selon la volont\\\\u00e9 des individus. Une structure ou communaut\\\\u00e9 peut comprendre plusieurs individus.</p>\\", \\"link\\": {\\"page\\": null, \\"external_url\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"\\"}, \\"link_label\\": \\"\\", \\"page\\": null, \\"link_url\\": \\"\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"6563f8da-4a7e-493b-8358-9e51f4352c1f\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"imageandtext\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 97, \\"image_side\\": \\"right\\", \\"image_ratio\\": \\"3\\", \\"text\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dkeo3\\\\\\">QUI SONT GRANDS VOISINS QUI VEULENT BIEN</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"19cun\\\\\\"><b>Association gouvern\\\\u00e9e par vous</b></h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"41mcs\\\\\\">Les individus gouvernent Les Grands Voisins. Les individus comprennent et d\\\\u00e9cident individuellement. Toute personne physique qui le souhaite, par seule sa propre volont\\\\u00e9, est membre votant des Grands Voisins. Seulement les individus (pas les structures) votent dans les Conseils des Grands Voisins. Nous sommes transparents pour tout individu qui souhaite des informations que nous pouvons fournir. Chaque individu peut faire partie d'une ou plusieurs structures ou communaut\\\\u00e9s.</p>\\", \\"link\\": {\\"page\\": null, \\"external_url\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"\\"}, \\"link_label\\": \\"\\", \\"page\\": null, \\"link_url\\": \\"\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"4dda2eb2-baa1-48df-be54-f7ecdee02f9a\\"}]", "section_3_body": "[]", "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 369, "translation_key": "b503fd04-9007-4d34-b340-c45938c9bcd4", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-06-09T09:14:04.064Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-09T08:35:47.374Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-09T09:14:04.039Z", "section_2_description_rich": ""}	\N	135	1	87	1	Le village des Grands Voisins
373	2024-06-09 11:35:39.770032+02	{"pk": 135, "body": "[]", "live": true, "path": "00010002000B", "slug": "le-village-des-grands-voisins", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Le village des Grands Voisins", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/le-village-des-grands-voisins/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Le village des Grands Voisins", "content_type": 87, "header_image": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": 372, "show_in_menus": false, "section_1_body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"multicolumns\\", \\"value\\": {\\"bg_image\\": null, \\"bg_color_class\\": \\"\\", \\"bg_color\\": \\"\\", \\"title\\": \\"\\", \\"heading_tag\\": \\"h2\\", \\"columns\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"value\\": \\"<h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"w1uv4\\\\\\">Les Grands Voisins<br/> car <b>l'autre</b> est une chance !</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6fefc\\\\\\">Nous sommes association coop\\\\u00e9rative pour l'int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat publique sur la base de notre d\\\\u00e9claration de mission.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3a7da\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/\\\\\\"><b>LesGrandsVoisins.fr</b></a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3hfou\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.resdigita.com/\\\\\\">ResDigita.com</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"b326d84c-6f90-4cb2-992a-718d65198627\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"video\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"\\", \\"caption\\": \\"Les Grands Voisins, la cit\\\\u00e9 r\\\\u00eav\\\\u00e9e\\", \\"url\\": \\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qZqErGfNF_o\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"ce39e208-107d-4c71-af8c-0e04d024d259\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"a786ba6e-81eb-4111-a58d-24313d175753\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"multicolumns\\", \\"value\\": {\\"bg_image\\": null, \\"bg_color_class\\": \\"\\", \\"bg_color\\": \\"\\", \\"title\\": \\"Activit\\\\u00e9s\\", \\"heading_tag\\": \\"h2\\", \\"columns\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"card\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Civisme\\", \\"description\\": \\"Nous nous proposons en tant \\\\u00ab qu'association coop\\\\u00e9rative d'int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat public \\\\u00bb. Cela fait que nous d\\\\u00e9cidons comme si nous \\\\u00e9tions une coop\\\\u00e9rative, sauf que tous nos services sont de, par et pour tous nos usagers. Nous nous appliquons alors des principes de transparence et d\\\\u2019ind\\\\u00e9pendance forts.\\", \\"image\\": 45, \\"url\\": \\"https://www.village.ngo/fr/activit%C3%A9s/civisme/\\", \\"document\\": null}, \\"id\\": \\"48217c4e-c6d5-4069-9d65-2095e6e8716d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"card\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Arts plastiques\\", \\"description\\": \\"Nous encourageons les artistes et les commer\\\\u00e7ants locaux \\\\u00e0 faire des popup expos, soutenons les artistes plasticiens et pr\\\\u00e9voyons d'organiser une vente aux ench\\\\u00e8res\\", \\"image\\": 50, \\"url\\": \\"https://www.village.ngo/fr/activit%C3%A9s/arts-plastiques/\\", \\"document\\": null}, \\"id\\": \\"c566bf79-f05e-4bf6-bdf1-df752d4d6cb7\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"card\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Num\\\\u00e9rique\\", \\"description\\": \\"Pouss\\\\u00e9s par la Mission des Grands Voisins et le Contrat pour le Web, nous avan\\\\u00e7ons avec assurance dans le num\\\\u00e9rique interd\\\\u00e9pendant et autonome des Grands Voisins par le d\\\\u00e9veloppement de salles de sociabilit\\\\u00e9 num\\\\u00e9riques, des partages de mat\\\\u00e9riaux entre structures, et des constellations de serveurs et de services.\\", \\"image\\": 49, \\"url\\": \\"https://www.village.ngo/fr/activit%C3%A9s/numerique/\\", \\"document\\": null}, \\"id\\": \\"c337e1a5-bc00-4651-9785-9761554cfe0a\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"e7581eeb-45bd-4c0d-949a-1f744d68225f\\"}]", "section_2_body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"imageandtext\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 96, \\"image_side\\": \\"right\\", \\"image_ratio\\": \\"5\\", \\"text\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dkeo3\\\\\\">UN VOISINAGE COMPL\\\\u00c9MENTAIRE</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"33a8d\\\\\\"><b>Des structures et collectifs</b></h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"30oc5\\\\\\">Les structures sont les canaux d\\\\u2019action \\\\u00e0 travers l\\\\u2019association coop\\\\u00e9rative d\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat public. Les structures peuvent \\\\u00eatre des associations, des entreprises, des professionnels, des artistes, des artisans, des collectifs, des services sociaux, ou des institutions publiques. Nous souhaitons fournir un soutien aux structures selon le principe de subsidiarit\\\\u00e9 et selon la volont\\\\u00e9 des individus. Une structure ou communaut\\\\u00e9 peut comprendre plusieurs individus.</p>\\", \\"link\\": {\\"page\\": null, \\"external_url\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"\\"}, \\"link_label\\": \\"\\", \\"page\\": null, \\"link_url\\": \\"\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"6563f8da-4a7e-493b-8358-9e51f4352c1f\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"imageandtext\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 97, \\"image_side\\": \\"left\\", \\"image_ratio\\": \\"5\\", \\"text\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dkeo3\\\\\\">QUI SONT GRANDS VOISINS QUI VEULENT BIEN</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"19cun\\\\\\"><b>Association gouvern\\\\u00e9e par vous</b></h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"41mcs\\\\\\">Les individus gouvernent Les Grands Voisins. Les individus comprennent et d\\\\u00e9cident individuellement. Toute personne physique qui le souhaite, par seule sa propre volont\\\\u00e9, est membre votant des Grands Voisins. Seulement les individus (pas les structures) votent dans les Conseils des Grands Voisins. Nous sommes transparents pour tout individu qui souhaite des informations que nous pouvons fournir. Chaque individu peut faire partie d'une ou plusieurs structures ou communaut\\\\u00e9s.</p>\\", \\"link\\": {\\"page\\": null, \\"external_url\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"\\"}, \\"link_label\\": \\"\\", \\"page\\": null, \\"link_url\\": \\"\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"4dda2eb2-baa1-48df-be54-f7ecdee02f9a\\"}]", "section_3_body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"accordions\\", \\"value\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"title\\", \\"value\\": \\"Les Grands Voisins\\", \\"id\\": \\"1c93f2da-7ff6-4f28-9ca0-f47d778816d1\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"accordion\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Quels sont les sites webs de l'association Les Grands Voisins ?\\", \\"content\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9a1ky\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr\\\\\\">LesGrandsVoisins.fr</a> : Le site public principal des Grands Voisins</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ejt7u\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.resdigita.com\\\\\\">ResDigita.com</a> : Le num\\\\u00e9rique des Grands Voisins se nomme ResDigita.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8tu6\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Blog.LesGrandsVoisins.com</a> : Notre blog (accessible depuis le site principal)</p>\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"48f40f9e-a2a1-4689-8e88-748e6be1672d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"accordion\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Quels sont les m\\\\u00e9dias sociaux de l'association ?\\", \\"content\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9a1ky\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.instagram.com/les_grands_voisins/\\\\\\">Instagram@les_grands_voisins</a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"eoa6g\\\\\\">Facebook</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"pdij\\\\\\">LinkedIn</p>\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"ebf17063-1f73-4f98-851a-d8324c7a4de3\\"}], \\"id\\": \\"d706e793-1ea0-4eb3-a841-21fe72ea3dad\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"accordions\\", \\"value\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"title\\", \\"value\\": \\"Le num\\\\u00e9rique des Grands Voisins\\", \\"id\\": \\"ff45b76a-acea-454b-8e28-75eb306188ef\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"accordion\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Quels sont les sites webs du num\\\\u00e9rique des Grands Voisins ?\\", \\"content\\": \\"<h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"9a1ky\\\\\\">Voici des points de d\\\\u00e9part pour les services num\\\\u00e9rique des Grands Voisins.</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9vkp5\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://homepage-dashboard.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Homepage-Dashboard</a> : le tableau de bord avec nos applications principales</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5fd1c\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://guichet.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Guichet (Login)</a> : G\\\\u00e9rer votre compte (guichet est un logiciel d\\\\u00e9velopp\\\\u00e9 par Les Grands Voisins)</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4cf9f\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://guichet.resdigita.com/user/new\\\\\\">Guichet (Inscription)</a> : Cr\\\\u00e9er votre compte</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"cq8sp\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/numerique/\\\\\\">LesGrandsVoisins.fr/numerique</a> : La description de nos activit\\\\u00e9s num\\\\u00e9riques</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bon42\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://quartz.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Quartz</a> : Consulter notre documentation sur les outils num\\\\u00e9riques (par exemple, configurer votre courriel)</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2vl81\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://uptime-kuma.resdigita.com/status/gv\\\\\\">Uptime-Kuma</a> : V\\\\u00e9rifier l'\\\\u00e9tat de nos services</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"91cvb\\\\\\">Voici des applications avec un login automatique :</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fpnrs\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://hedgedoc.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Hedgedoc</a> : Edition en temps r\\\\u00e9el de documents partag\\\\u00e9s</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"66ktd\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://vikunja.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Vikunja</a> : Centraliser des informations sur des tous doux lisses</p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"7ajqp\\\\\\">Voici <a href=\\\\\\"https://vaultwarden.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Vaultwarden</a>  pour vos mots de passe :</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"82lnm\\\\\\">Le login et le mot de passe sont ind\\\\u00e9pendants et s\\\\u00e9curis\\\\u00e9s comme nous le pouvons.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"45po\\\\\\">Ce dispositif est compatible avec tous <a href=\\\\\\"https://bitwarden.com/fr-fr/download/\\\\\\">les clients BitWarden</a> (t\\\\u00e9l\\\\u00e9d\\\\u00e9chagement pour ios, Android, Windows, Linux et Apple). Mettez \\\\u00ab self-hosted \\\\u00bb ou \\\\u00ab auto-h\\\\u00e9berg\\\\u00e9 \\\\u00bb avec l'adresse https://vaultwarden.resdigita.com.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7ksh4\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://vaultwarden.resdigita.com\\\\\\">https://vaultwarden.resdigita.com</a></p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"9l97p\\\\\\">Voici des services en lien avec le courriel</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"739t7\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://mail.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Roundcube Webmail</a> : Acc\\\\u00e9der \\\\u00e0 vos mels par le web</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3ktr5\\\\\\">Le courriel est cr\\\\u00e9\\\\u00e9 dans <a href=\\\\\\"https://guichet.resdigita.com/user\\\\\\">Guichet dans la partie \\\\u00ab modifier mon profil \\\\u00bb</a>. Chaque courriel que vous ajoutez sera un login distinct avec le m\\\\u00eame mot de passe que vous utilisez pour Guichet.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3fmfb\\\\\\">La <a href=\\\\\\"https://quartz.resdigita.com/config/services/email\\\\\\">documentation dans Quartz</a> peut vous aider \\\\u00e0 la configuration de votre courriel (sur smartphone par exemple).</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"djdi9\\\\\\">La <a href=\\\\\\"https://guichet.resdigita.com/user/new\\\\\\">cr\\\\u00e9ation de compte sur Guichet</a> cr\\\\u00e9e automatiquement un courriel correspondant.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bgda4\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://list.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">ListMonk</a> : Envois de Newsletters et gestions d'abonnements</p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"d569v\\\\\\">Voici des dispositifs d'administration web.</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1vn6g\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://wagtail.resdigita.com/admin/\\\\\\">Wagtail.Resdigita.Com</a> : Editer nos sites webs principaux</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"70gbi\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com/ghost/\\\\\\">blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com/ghost</a> : Editer notre blog</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7no76\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://list.lesgrandsvoisins.com/\\\\\\">List Monk list</a> : Envoyer des newsletters</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"etp8u\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://uptime-kuma.resdigita.com/\\\\\\">Uptime Kuma admin</a> : Adminsitrer le tableau des statuts des services</p>\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"02aab8cf-18e1-47a3-8d1c-10eba1d6e4be\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"accordion\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Quels sont les outils r\\\\u00e9galiens pour des sites citoyens ?\\", \\"content\\": \\"<h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"9a1ky\\\\\\">Wagtail-Fastoche pour vos cha\\\\u00eenes d'\\\\u00e9dition num\\\\u00e9riques</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bvj84\\\\\\">site-exemple : <a href=\\\\\\"https://wagtail.village.ngo\\\\\\">wagtail.village.ngo</a><br/>d\\\\u00e9p\\\\u00f4t source : <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/chris2fr/wagtail-village\\\\\\">github.com/chris2fr/wagtail-village</a><br/>bifurqu\\\\u00e9 depuis <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/nurmerique-gouv/sites-faciles\\\\\\">github.com/nurmerique-gouv/sites-faciles</a></p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"52sc1\\\\\\">Django-Fastoche pour vos applications webs</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"aihb0\\\\\\">site-exemple : <a href=\\\\\\"https://django.village.ngo\\\\\\">django.village.ngo</a><br/>d\\\\u00e9p\\\\u00f4t source : <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/chris2fr/django-village\\\\\\">github.com/chris2fr/django-village</a><br/>bifurqu\\\\u00e9 depuis <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr\\\\\\">github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr</a></p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"49ves\\\\\\">Fabrique-Fastoche pour vos syst\\\\u00e8mes de design num\\\\u00e9riques</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9sev6\\\\\\">site-exemple : <a href=\\\\\\"https://django.village.ngo\\\\\\">django.village.ngo</a><br/>d\\\\u00e9p\\\\u00f4t source : <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/chris2fr/django-village\\\\\\">github.com/chris2fr/django-village</a><br/>bifurqu\\\\u00e9 depuis <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr\\\\\\">github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr</a></p>\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"2f37fca9-a97b-48c3-abfd-be57a9803cae\\"}], \\"id\\": \\"47f8669d-9804-451f-a9cd-79264d0409ea\\"}]", "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 372, "translation_key": "b503fd04-9007-4d34-b340-c45938c9bcd4", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-06-09T09:24:45.624Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-09T08:35:47.374Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-09T09:24:45.599Z", "section_2_description_rich": "<p data-block-key=\\"hrhup\\">Notre village est construit d'acteurs socio-économiques et d'individus. Nous nous trouvons toutes et tous à l'intersection de ces deux concepts. Bien que dans le village, nous voyons d'abord les entités -- personnes physiques et personnes morales -- nous décidons pour une bonne partie en personnes individuelles et consciencieuses, en grands voisins selon la définition subjective de chacune et de chacun de ce que c'est être grande voisine ou être grand voisin.</p>"}	\N	135	1	87	1	Le village des Grands Voisins
374	2024-06-09 11:38:00.390166+02	{"pk": 135, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"rqezc\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/numerique/numerique-creatif/sociabilite-numerique/\\\\\\"><b>Sociabilit\\\\u00e9 num\\\\u00e9rique le lundi de 17h \\\\u00e0 21h30</b></a></h3><embed embedtype=\\\\\\"image\\\\\\" format=\\\\\\"right\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\"22\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\"numasso\\\\\\"/><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9m956\\\\\\"><b>Le lundi de 17h \\\\u00e0 21h30</b> se tient un atelier d\\\\u2019entraide num\\\\u00e9rique \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019Atelier au <b>93 ave. du G\\\\u00e9n. Leclerc 75014 PARIS</b> \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9rieur du <i>centre commercial 7e boutique sur la gauche</i></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"a83af2ac-0da6-4495-a86a-aa95c53fcf03\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "00010002000B", "slug": "le-village-des-grands-voisins", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Le village des Grands Voisins", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/le-village-des-grands-voisins/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Le village des Grands Voisins", "content_type": 87, "header_image": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": 372, "show_in_menus": false, "section_1_body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"multicolumns\\", \\"value\\": {\\"bg_image\\": null, \\"bg_color_class\\": \\"\\", \\"bg_color\\": \\"\\", \\"title\\": \\"\\", \\"heading_tag\\": \\"h2\\", \\"columns\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"value\\": \\"<h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"w1uv4\\\\\\">Les Grands Voisins<br/> car <b>l'autre</b> est une chance !</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6fefc\\\\\\">Nous sommes association coop\\\\u00e9rative pour l'int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat publique sur la base de notre d\\\\u00e9claration de mission.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3a7da\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/\\\\\\"><b>LesGrandsVoisins.fr</b></a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3hfou\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.resdigita.com/\\\\\\">ResDigita.com</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"b326d84c-6f90-4cb2-992a-718d65198627\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"video\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"\\", \\"caption\\": \\"Les Grands Voisins, la cit\\\\u00e9 r\\\\u00eav\\\\u00e9e\\", \\"url\\": \\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qZqErGfNF_o\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"ce39e208-107d-4c71-af8c-0e04d024d259\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"a786ba6e-81eb-4111-a58d-24313d175753\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"multicolumns\\", \\"value\\": {\\"bg_image\\": null, \\"bg_color_class\\": \\"\\", \\"bg_color\\": \\"\\", \\"title\\": \\"Activit\\\\u00e9s\\", \\"heading_tag\\": \\"h2\\", \\"columns\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"card\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Civisme\\", \\"description\\": \\"Nous nous proposons en tant \\\\u00ab qu'association coop\\\\u00e9rative d'int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat public \\\\u00bb. Cela fait que nous d\\\\u00e9cidons comme si nous \\\\u00e9tions une coop\\\\u00e9rative, sauf que tous nos services sont de, par et pour tous nos usagers. Nous nous appliquons alors des principes de transparence et d\\\\u2019ind\\\\u00e9pendance forts.\\", \\"image\\": 45, \\"url\\": \\"https://www.village.ngo/fr/activit%C3%A9s/civisme/\\", \\"document\\": null}, \\"id\\": \\"48217c4e-c6d5-4069-9d65-2095e6e8716d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"card\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Arts plastiques\\", \\"description\\": \\"Nous encourageons les artistes et les commer\\\\u00e7ants locaux \\\\u00e0 faire des popup expos, soutenons les artistes plasticiens et pr\\\\u00e9voyons d'organiser une vente aux ench\\\\u00e8res\\", \\"image\\": 50, \\"url\\": \\"https://www.village.ngo/fr/activit%C3%A9s/arts-plastiques/\\", \\"document\\": null}, \\"id\\": \\"c566bf79-f05e-4bf6-bdf1-df752d4d6cb7\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"card\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Num\\\\u00e9rique\\", \\"description\\": \\"Pouss\\\\u00e9s par la Mission des Grands Voisins et le Contrat pour le Web, nous avan\\\\u00e7ons avec assurance dans le num\\\\u00e9rique interd\\\\u00e9pendant et autonome des Grands Voisins par le d\\\\u00e9veloppement de salles de sociabilit\\\\u00e9 num\\\\u00e9riques, des partages de mat\\\\u00e9riaux entre structures, et des constellations de serveurs et de services.\\", \\"image\\": 49, \\"url\\": \\"https://www.village.ngo/fr/activit%C3%A9s/numerique/\\", \\"document\\": null}, \\"id\\": \\"c337e1a5-bc00-4651-9785-9761554cfe0a\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"e7581eeb-45bd-4c0d-949a-1f744d68225f\\"}]", "section_2_body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"imageandtext\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 96, \\"image_side\\": \\"right\\", \\"image_ratio\\": \\"5\\", \\"text\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dkeo3\\\\\\">UN VOISINAGE COMPL\\\\u00c9MENTAIRE</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"33a8d\\\\\\"><b>Des structures et collectifs</b></h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"30oc5\\\\\\">Les structures sont les canaux d\\\\u2019action \\\\u00e0 travers l\\\\u2019association coop\\\\u00e9rative d\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat public. Les structures peuvent \\\\u00eatre des associations, des entreprises, des professionnels, des artistes, des artisans, des collectifs, des services sociaux, ou des institutions publiques. Nous souhaitons fournir un soutien aux structures selon le principe de subsidiarit\\\\u00e9 et selon la volont\\\\u00e9 des individus. Une structure ou communaut\\\\u00e9 peut comprendre plusieurs individus.</p>\\", \\"link\\": {\\"page\\": null, \\"external_url\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"\\"}, \\"link_label\\": \\"\\", \\"page\\": null, \\"link_url\\": \\"\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"6563f8da-4a7e-493b-8358-9e51f4352c1f\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"imageandtext\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 97, \\"image_side\\": \\"left\\", \\"image_ratio\\": \\"5\\", \\"text\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dkeo3\\\\\\">QUI SONT GRANDS VOISINS QUI VEULENT BIEN</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"19cun\\\\\\"><b>Association gouvern\\\\u00e9e par vous</b></h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"41mcs\\\\\\">Les individus gouvernent Les Grands Voisins. Les individus comprennent et d\\\\u00e9cident individuellement. Toute personne physique qui le souhaite, par seule sa propre volont\\\\u00e9, est membre votant des Grands Voisins. Seulement les individus (pas les structures) votent dans les Conseils des Grands Voisins. Nous sommes transparents pour tout individu qui souhaite des informations que nous pouvons fournir. Chaque individu peut faire partie d'une ou plusieurs structures ou communaut\\\\u00e9s.</p>\\", \\"link\\": {\\"page\\": null, \\"external_url\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"\\"}, \\"link_label\\": \\"\\", \\"page\\": null, \\"link_url\\": \\"\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"4dda2eb2-baa1-48df-be54-f7ecdee02f9a\\"}]", "section_3_body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"accordions\\", \\"value\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"title\\", \\"value\\": \\"Les Grands Voisins\\", \\"id\\": \\"1c93f2da-7ff6-4f28-9ca0-f47d778816d1\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"accordion\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Quels sont les sites webs de l'association Les Grands Voisins ?\\", \\"content\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9a1ky\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr\\\\\\">LesGrandsVoisins.fr</a> : Le site public principal des Grands Voisins</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ejt7u\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.resdigita.com\\\\\\">ResDigita.com</a> : Le num\\\\u00e9rique des Grands Voisins se nomme ResDigita.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8tu6\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Blog.LesGrandsVoisins.com</a> : Notre blog (accessible depuis le site principal)</p>\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"48f40f9e-a2a1-4689-8e88-748e6be1672d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"accordion\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Quels sont les m\\\\u00e9dias sociaux de l'association ?\\", \\"content\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9a1ky\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.instagram.com/les_grands_voisins/\\\\\\">Instagram@les_grands_voisins</a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"eoa6g\\\\\\">Facebook</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"pdij\\\\\\">LinkedIn</p>\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"ebf17063-1f73-4f98-851a-d8324c7a4de3\\"}], \\"id\\": \\"d706e793-1ea0-4eb3-a841-21fe72ea3dad\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"accordions\\", \\"value\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"title\\", \\"value\\": \\"Le num\\\\u00e9rique des Grands Voisins\\", \\"id\\": \\"ff45b76a-acea-454b-8e28-75eb306188ef\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"accordion\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Quels sont les sites webs du num\\\\u00e9rique des Grands Voisins ?\\", \\"content\\": \\"<h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"9a1ky\\\\\\">Voici des points de d\\\\u00e9part pour les services num\\\\u00e9rique des Grands Voisins.</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9vkp5\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://homepage-dashboard.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Homepage-Dashboard</a> : le tableau de bord avec nos applications principales</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5fd1c\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://guichet.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Guichet (Login)</a> : G\\\\u00e9rer votre compte (guichet est un logiciel d\\\\u00e9velopp\\\\u00e9 par Les Grands Voisins)</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4cf9f\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://guichet.resdigita.com/user/new\\\\\\">Guichet (Inscription)</a> : Cr\\\\u00e9er votre compte</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"cq8sp\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/numerique/\\\\\\">LesGrandsVoisins.fr/numerique</a> : La description de nos activit\\\\u00e9s num\\\\u00e9riques</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bon42\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://quartz.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Quartz</a> : Consulter notre documentation sur les outils num\\\\u00e9riques (par exemple, configurer votre courriel)</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2vl81\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://uptime-kuma.resdigita.com/status/gv\\\\\\">Uptime-Kuma</a> : V\\\\u00e9rifier l'\\\\u00e9tat de nos services</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"91cvb\\\\\\">Voici des applications avec un login automatique :</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fpnrs\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://hedgedoc.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Hedgedoc</a> : Edition en temps r\\\\u00e9el de documents partag\\\\u00e9s</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"66ktd\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://vikunja.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Vikunja</a> : Centraliser des informations sur des tous doux lisses</p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"7ajqp\\\\\\">Voici <a href=\\\\\\"https://vaultwarden.resdigita.com\\\\\\">Vaultwarden</a> pour vos mots de passe :</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"82lnm\\\\\\">Le login et le mot de passe sont ind\\\\u00e9pendants et s\\\\u00e9curis\\\\u00e9s comme nous le pouvons.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"45po\\\\\\">Ce dispositif est compatible avec tous <a href=\\\\\\"https://bitwarden.com/fr-fr/download/\\\\\\">les clients BitWarden</a> (t\\\\u00e9l\\\\u00e9d\\\\u00e9chagement pour ios, Android, Windows, Linux et Apple). Mettez \\\\u00ab self-hosted \\\\u00bb ou \\\\u00ab auto-h\\\\u00e9berg\\\\u00e9 \\\\u00bb avec l'adresse https://vaultwarden.resdigita.com.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7ksh4\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://vaultwarden.resdigita.com\\\\\\">https://vaultwarden.resdigita.com</a></p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"9l97p\\\\\\">Voici des services en lien avec le courriel</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"739t7\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://mail.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Roundcube Webmail</a> : Acc\\\\u00e9der \\\\u00e0 vos mels par le web</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3ktr5\\\\\\">Le courriel est cr\\\\u00e9\\\\u00e9 dans <a href=\\\\\\"https://guichet.resdigita.com/user\\\\\\">Guichet dans la partie \\\\u00ab modifier mon profil \\\\u00bb</a>. Chaque courriel que vous ajoutez sera un login distinct avec le m\\\\u00eame mot de passe que vous utilisez pour Guichet.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3fmfb\\\\\\">La <a href=\\\\\\"https://quartz.resdigita.com/config/services/email\\\\\\">documentation dans Quartz</a> peut vous aider \\\\u00e0 la configuration de votre courriel (sur smartphone par exemple).</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"djdi9\\\\\\">La <a href=\\\\\\"https://guichet.resdigita.com/user/new\\\\\\">cr\\\\u00e9ation de compte sur Guichet</a> cr\\\\u00e9e automatiquement un courriel correspondant.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bgda4\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://list.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">ListMonk</a> : Envois de Newsletters et gestions d'abonnements</p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"d569v\\\\\\">Voici des dispositifs d'administration web.</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1vn6g\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://wagtail.resdigita.com/admin/\\\\\\">Wagtail.Resdigita.Com</a> : Editer nos sites webs principaux</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"70gbi\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com/ghost/\\\\\\">blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com/ghost</a> : Editer notre blog</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7no76\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://list.lesgrandsvoisins.com/\\\\\\">List Monk list</a> : Envoyer des newsletters</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"etp8u\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://uptime-kuma.resdigita.com/\\\\\\">Uptime Kuma admin</a> : Adminsitrer le tableau des statuts des services</p>\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"02aab8cf-18e1-47a3-8d1c-10eba1d6e4be\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"accordion\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Quels sont les outils r\\\\u00e9galiens pour des sites citoyens ?\\", \\"content\\": \\"<h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"9a1ky\\\\\\">Wagtail-Fastoche pour vos cha\\\\u00eenes d'\\\\u00e9dition num\\\\u00e9riques</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"bvj84\\\\\\">site-exemple : <a href=\\\\\\"https://wagtail.village.ngo\\\\\\">wagtail.village.ngo</a><br/>d\\\\u00e9p\\\\u00f4t source : <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/chris2fr/wagtail-village\\\\\\">github.com/chris2fr/wagtail-village</a><br/>bifurqu\\\\u00e9 depuis <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/nurmerique-gouv/sites-faciles\\\\\\">github.com/nurmerique-gouv/sites-faciles</a></p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"52sc1\\\\\\">Django-Fastoche pour vos applications webs</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"aihb0\\\\\\">site-exemple : <a href=\\\\\\"https://django.village.ngo\\\\\\">django.village.ngo</a><br/>d\\\\u00e9p\\\\u00f4t source : <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/chris2fr/django-village\\\\\\">github.com/chris2fr/django-village</a><br/>bifurqu\\\\u00e9 depuis <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr\\\\\\">github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr</a></p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"49ves\\\\\\">Fabrique-Fastoche pour vos syst\\\\u00e8mes de design num\\\\u00e9riques</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9sev6\\\\\\">site-exemple : <a href=\\\\\\"https://django.village.ngo\\\\\\">django.village.ngo</a><br/>d\\\\u00e9p\\\\u00f4t source : <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/chris2fr/django-village\\\\\\">github.com/chris2fr/django-village</a><br/>bifurqu\\\\u00e9 depuis <a href=\\\\\\"https://github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr\\\\\\">github.com/nurmerique-gouv/django-dsfr</a></p>\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"2f37fca9-a97b-48c3-abfd-be57a9803cae\\"}], \\"id\\": \\"47f8669d-9804-451f-a9cd-79264d0409ea\\"}]", "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 373, "translation_key": "b503fd04-9007-4d34-b340-c45938c9bcd4", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-06-09T09:24:45.624Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-09T08:35:47.374Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-09T09:35:39.770Z", "section_2_description_rich": "<p data-block-key=\\"hrhup\\">Notre village est construit d'acteurs socio-économiques et d'individus. Nous nous trouvons toutes et tous à l'intersection de ces deux concepts. Bien que dans le village, nous voyons d'abord les entités -- personnes physiques et personnes morales -- nous décidons pour une bonne partie en personnes individuelles et consciencieuses, en grands voisins selon la définition subjective de chacune et de chacun de ce que c'est être grande voisine ou être grand voisin.</p>"}	\N	135	1	87	1	Le village des Grands Voisins
247	2024-06-01 16:52:54.934896+02	{"pk": 95, "body": "[]", "date": "2022-05-22T10:41:00Z", "live": false, "path": "000100030003000A", "slug": "point-sur-les-avancements-en-mai-2022", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "Point sur les avancements en mai 2022", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [1], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/blog/point-sur-les-avancements-en-mai-2022/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Point sur les avancements en mai 2022", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 70, "header_large": true, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 246, "translation_key": "2cebba7e-72c5-4ae8-acfb-586d729ea3af", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Nous avons du pain sur la planche et avons lentement fait des progrès dont je suis très heureux de vous en faire part ici.", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-01T14:52:54.898Z"}	\N	95	1	71	1	Point sur les avancements en mai 2022
632	2024-06-19 16:56:06.739158+02	{"pk": 147, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"gqc5e\\\\\\">Denis Decastro</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"du74\\\\\\">Denis de Castro est un chercheur en m\\\\u00e9decine, qui travaillait auparavant, je crois, au CNRS, dans le centre de Paris. Denis vit maintenant \\\\u00e0 Dunedun, en Australie. Avant de prendre sa retraite, Denis traitait des donn\\\\u00e9es volumineuses en langage R et faisait des blagues, apportant de la lumi\\\\u00e8re \\\\u00e0 son \\\\u00e9quipe de recherche. Aujourd'hui, Denis est un contributeur important de Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"87bn5\\\\\\">Denis de Castro is a medical research scientist, previously I think with the CNRS in central Paris. Denis now lives in Dunedun Australia. Prior to retirement, Denis processed big data in R-languages and made jokes, bringing light to his research team. Today, Denis is a significant contributor to Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2e40h\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://auckland.academia.edu/DenisdeCastro?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Academia.edu</a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"32uv4\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.researchgate.net/scientific-contributions/Denis-de-Castro-33850121?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Researchgate</a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5qm44\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://flaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">flaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com</a><br/></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"8knt\\\\\\">Email</li></ul>\\", \\"id\\": \\"2b93b62d-b019-4a9b-a438-ba97546874d0\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:47:00Z", "live": true, "path": "0001000400050009", "slug": "bmcp-bio-medical-consulting-paris-also-aukland-and-dunedin", "depth": 4, "owner": 2, "title": "BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/bmcp-bio-medical-consulting-paris-also-aukland-and-dunedin/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 107, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": 494, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [3], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 494, "translation_key": "4dc52cb9-7c1c-4a68-adf0-490f07a1e9fb", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": "2024-06-18T13:48:45.030Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-18T13:48:45.030Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Denis Decastro\\r\\n\\r\\nDenis de Castro est un chercheur en médecine, qui travaillait auparavant, je crois, au CNRS, dans le centre de Paris. Denis vit maintenant à Dunedun, en Australie. Avant de prendre sa retraite, Denis traitait des données volumineuses en langage R et faisait des blagues, apportant de la lumière à son équipe de recherche. Aujourd'hui, Denis est un contributeur important de Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.\\r\\n\\r\\nDenis de Castro is a medical research scientist, previously I think with the CNRS in central Paris. Denis now lives in Dunedun Australia. Prior to retirement, Denis processed big data in R-languages and made jokes, bringing light to his research team. Today, Denis is a significant contributor to Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.\\r\\n\\r\\nAcademia.edu\\r\\nResearchgate\\r\\nflaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\r\\nEmail", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-18T13:48:45.010Z"}	\N	147	2	71	1	BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)
634	2024-06-19 16:56:19.21745+02	{"pk": 146, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1uxf0\\\\\\">Photographer and documentary filmmaker</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1lb2s\\\\\\">Robert Baldridge has worked as a freelance photojournalist for over 40 years. His work has been published in the NYTimes , Vanity Fair, VOGUE , and by other magazines in Europe and South America . His work is in the vain of the concerned photography tradition.<br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge</a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1ramh\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22Robert+%22Bob%22+Baldridge%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Robert \\\\\\"Bob\\\\\\" Baldridge</a> is a long-time Greenwich resident. For years he has used his camera to document his experiences, along with those of others. His work has appeared in Vogue, The <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22New+York+Times+Magazine%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">New York Times Magazine</a> and other publications abroad. He's especially drawn to recording the works-in-progress of other artists. He's documenting actor <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22Matt+Dillon%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Matt Dillon</a>'s philanthropic work centered on a Rwandan doctor in Africa, and he's been documenting the <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22Dalai+Lama%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Dalai Lama</a> and his fellow Tibetans in exile in India.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ebjsm\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/news/article/Local-photographer-sheds-light-on-the-art-of-4768898.php?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com#photo-5117574\\\\\\">https://www.greenwichtime.com/news/article/Local-photographer-sheds-light-on-the-art-of-4768898.php#photo-5117574</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.instagram.com/robertbaldridgeofficial/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.instagram.com/robertbaldridgeofficial/</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?modal=project-1467194&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?modal=project-1467194</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://gmpphoto.blogspot.com/2021/12/lisl-steiner-in-cerro-muriano-cordoba.html?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://gmpphoto.blogspot.com/2021/12/lisl-steiner-in-cerro-muriano-cordoba.html</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"94081c06-5ca7-420c-ab85-2f18d44f3622\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:45:00Z", "live": true, "path": "0001000400050008", "slug": "robert-baldridge", "depth": 4, "owner": 2, "title": "Robert Baldridge", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/robert-baldridge/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Robert Baldridge", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 106, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": 492, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [1], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 492, "translation_key": "5efeed0c-1c6d-4179-95ae-a62757d9ecfa", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": "2024-06-18T13:47:02.103Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-18T13:47:02.103Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Photographer and documentary filmmaker\\r\\n\\r\\nRobert Baldridge has worked as a freelance photojournalist for over 40 years. His work has been published in the NYTimes , Vanity Fair, VOGUE , and by other magazines in Europe and South America . His work is in the vain of the concerned photography tradition.\\r\\nhttps://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge\\r\\n\\r\\nRobert \\"Bob\\" Baldridge is a long-time Greenwich resident. For years he has used his camera to document his experiences, along with those of others. His work has appeared in Vogue, The New York Times Magazine and other publications abroad. He's especially drawn to recording the works-in-progress of other artists. He's documenting actor Matt Dillon's philanthropic work centered on a Rwandan doctor in Africa, and he's been documenting the Dalai Lama and his fellow Tibetans in exile in India.\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://www.greenwichtime.com/news/article/Local-photographer-sheds-light-on-the-art-of-4768898.php#photo-5117574\\r\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/robertbaldridgeofficial/\\r\\nhttps://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?modal=project-1467194\\r\\nhttps://gmpphoto.blogspot.com/2021/12/lisl-steiner-in-cerro-muriano-cordoba.html", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-18T13:47:02.078Z"}	\N	146	2	71	1	Robert Baldridge
365	2024-06-09 10:59:47.769878+02	{"pk": 135, "body": "[]", "live": true, "path": "00010002000B", "slug": "le-village-des-grands-voisins", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Le village des Grands Voisins", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/le-village-des-grands-voisins/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Le village des Grands Voisins", "content_type": 87, "header_image": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": 363, "show_in_menus": false, "section_1_body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"imageandtext\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 95, \\"image_side\\": \\"right\\", \\"image_ratio\\": \\"5\\", \\"text\\": \\"<h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"ean3z\\\\\\">Les Grands Voisins<br/> car <b>l'autre</b> est une chance !</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"clgl\\\\\\">Nous sommes association coop\\\\u00e9rative pour l'int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat publique sur la base de notre d\\\\u00e9claration de mission.<br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/\\\\\\">LesGrandsVoisins.fr</a><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.resdigita.com/\\\\\\">ResDigita.com</a></p>\\", \\"link\\": {\\"page\\": null, \\"external_url\\": \\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qZqErGfNF_o\\", \\"text\\": \\"Les Grands Voisins, la cit\\\\u00e9 r\\\\u00eav\\\\u00e9e\\"}, \\"link_label\\": \\"\\", \\"page\\": null, \\"link_url\\": \\"\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"cea8943a-5585-4b98-8508-37763829c003\\"}]", "section_2_body": "[]", "section_3_body": "[]", "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 364, "translation_key": "b503fd04-9007-4d34-b340-c45938c9bcd4", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-06-09T08:35:47.374Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-09T08:35:47.374Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revi