262	2024-06-01 16:52:56.741723+02	{"pk": 103, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"e5ckw\\\\\\">Entre</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"64dbi\\\\\\">Les Grands Voisins, association coop\\\\u00e9rative<br/>ci-apr\\\\u00e8s Les Grands Voisins</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"90i75\\\\\\">et</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8hgdo\\\\\\">[Le ou la Grand(e) Voisin(e)]<br/>[Artiste, artisan, professionnel, association, entreprise] [addresse postale]<br/>[addresse \\\\u00e9lectronique] [t\\\\u00e9l\\\\u00e9phone]<br/>repr\\\\u00e9sent\\\\u00e9(e) par [Personne signataire et \\\\u00e9ventuellement titre]<br/>ci-apr\\\\u00e8s La Personne Voisine</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"61kv6\\\\\\">Par la pr\\\\u00e9sente, les deux parties acceptent la charte d\\\\u2019adh\\\\u00e9sion jointe \\\\u00e0 la pr\\\\u00e9sente est accessible sur le URL suivant <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.com/fr/voisins/charte?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Les Grands Voisins</a> au moment de la signature</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ckh1i\\\\\\">pour une dur\\\\u00e9e d\\\\u2019un an \\\\u00e0 partir du jour de la signature</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6o1gr\\\\\\">pour un montant mensuel de _________________ euros. La Personne Voisine peut r\\\\u00e9gler l\\\\u2019abonnement en douze quittances mensuelles ou peut r\\\\u00e9gler en une fois annuellement dix fois le montant.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1i8o7\\\\\\">fait \\\\u00e0 _______________________<br/>le ____________________<br/>en deux exemplaires</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"317no\\\\\\">Les Grands Voisins (lu et approuv\\\\u00e9)</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6tigu\\\\\\">.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fdnc\\\\\\">La Personne Voisine (lu et approuv\\\\u00e9)</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"a1e1b\\\\\\">Voir aussi:</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"ffihq\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://com.grandsvoisins.com/t/charte-dabonnement-ess/183?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Charte d\\\\u2019abonnement ESS 2</a></li></ul>\\", \\"id\\": \\"e634a06b-dc85-4aac-9521-59eb1851955f\\"}]", "date": "2021-11-16T11:00:00Z", "live": false, "path": "000100030003000I", "slug": "bon-dadhésion-ess", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "Bon d'adhésion ESS", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [1], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/blog/bon-dadhésion-ess/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Bon d'adhésion ESS", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 27, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "503d1f4e-3add-449a-846c-29051efec98b", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Entre Les Grands Voisins, association coopérative ci-après Les Grands Voisins et [Le ou la Grand(e) Voisin(e)] [Artiste, artisan, professionnel, association, […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-05-29T10:53:06.954Z"}	\N	103	\N	71	1	Bon d'adhésion ESS
