838	2024-06-24 14:09:55.798037+02	{"pk": 200, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fbjop\\\\\\">Venez nous rencontrer \\\\u00e0 L'atelier de la Ressourcerie Cr\\\\u00e9ative le lundi :</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"cbu96\\\\\\">Permanence entre 10h et 16h</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"6e77u\\\\\\">Salle de sociabilit\\\\u00e9 num\\\\u00e9rique entre 16h et 19h</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1jri3\\\\\\">A L'atelier de la Ressourcerie Cr\\\\u00e9ative \\\\u00e0</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2n270\\\\\\">Le Square<br/>93 ave. du G\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9ral Leclerc<br/>75014 PARIS</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"26nu8\\\\\\">M\\\\u00e9tro 4 : Al\\\\u00e9sia<br/>Tram 3b, Bus 128, 194, ... : Porte d'Orl\\\\u00e9ans<br/>Bus 38, 68 et 92 : Arr\\\\u00eat G\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9ral Leclerc - Al\\\\u00e9sia</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2jj1c\\\\\\">Quand vous \\\\u00eates sur place, entrez de pr\\\\u00e9f\\\\u00e9rence sur la gauche (93 au lieu de 95), passer devant le coiffure sur votre gauche et le poste de s\\\\u00e9curit\\\\u00e9 sur votre droite puis l'Atelier se trouve sur la gauche juste apr\\\\u00e8s un magasin de suppl\\\\u00e9ments alimentaires.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"64fom\\\\\\">Au plaisir de vous y retrouver :)</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"es12l\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/\\\\\\"><b>Les Grands Voisins</b></a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"6g09e\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/mission/\\\\\\"><b>A propos</b></a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"1sdd7\\\\\\"><b>Permanence le lundi entre 10h et 16h</b></li></ul>\\", \\"id\\": \\"0aac3677-0cd1-4c4b-bb40-f6893d27d91e\\"}]", "live": false, "path": "0001000400020009", "slug": "permanence-le-lundi-entre-10h-et-16h", "depth": 4, "owner": 2, "title": "Permanence le lundi entre 10h et 16h", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/association/permanence-le-lundi-entre-10h-et-16h/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Permanence le lundi entre 10h et 16h", "content_type": 25, "header_image": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": false, "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "af3b4001-9700-4390-86e4-851c073e8be8", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Venez nous rencontrer à L'atelier de la Ressourcerie Créative le lundi : Permanence entre 10h et 16h Salle de sociabilité […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": null}	\N	200	2	25	1	Permanence le lundi entre 10h et 16h
677	2024-06-20 15:30:33.422257+02	{"pk": 140, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9tl7c\\\\\\">L'art, Julio n'en est pas simplement une oeuvre, Julio est r\\\\u00e9velateur en tant qu'art th\\\\u00e9rapeute.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"9e52a79b-9dc0-47dc-9fa0-973e0133739f\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"video\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Entretien avec Julio Rodriguez, Art Th\\\\u00e9rapeute et responsable des Arts Voisins\\", \\"caption\\": \\"Julio Rodriguez, Art Th\\\\u00e9rapeute, nouveau responsable des Arts Voisins des Grands Voisins sur VillageNgo\\", \\"url\\": \\"https://youtube.com/embed/ebvhd0TLkfY\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"d863f525-7fed-4dca-985d-7a72c263f2aa\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-17T19:10:00Z", "live": true, "path": "0001000400050002", "slug": "julio-rodriguez-art-thérapeute", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "Julio Rodriguez, Art-Thérapeute", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/julio-rodriguez-art-thérapeute/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Julio Rodriguez, Art-Thérapeute", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 99, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": 675, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [1], "header_cta_link": "https://youtube.com/embed/ebvhd0TLkfY", "header_cta_text": "Voir le site et l'appli", "latest_revision": 675, "translation_key": "d1bc6b2c-9f28-4476-8180-8ae4375422dc", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [{"pk": 100, "page": 140, "category": 1}], "header_cta_label": "https://youtube.com/embed/ebvhd0TLkfY", "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-06-20T13:29:50.919Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-17T19:45:22.747Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "L'art, Julio n'en est pas simplement une oeuvre, Julio est révelateur en tant qu'art thér