840	2024-06-24 14:11:03.150924+02	{"pk": 201, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"y1rca\\\\\\">Merci de votre int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat et vos contributions en temps, en expertise, en mat\\\\u00e9riel, en services ou en num\\\\u00e9raire. Vous pouvez aussi faire partie de nos activit\\\\u00e9s et faire don de vos pr\\\\u00e9sences, chose tr\\\\u00e8s ch\\\\u00e8re.</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"4u81n\\\\\\">Dons en num\\\\u00e9raire</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"cd30k\\\\\\">Les Grands Voisins re\\\\u00e7oit des donations d\\\\u00e9ductibles des imp\\\\u00f4ts. Nous vous \\\\u00e9tablissons une d\\\\u00e9claration en fin d'ann\\\\u00e9e. Ceci se base sur notre d\\\\u00e9vouement \\\\u00e0 l'int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat g\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9ral.</p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"f2bc\\\\\\">Par virement bancaire </h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4apru\\\\\\">Nos coordonn\\\\u00e9es bancaires:<br/>D\\\\u00e9tenteur de compte: Les Grands Voisins<br/>IBAN: IE44SUMU99036510816207<br/>BIC: SUMUIE22XXX<br/>Institution financi\\\\u00e8re : SumUp Limited</p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"83feg\\\\\\">Paypal associations</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"b6b0v\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=BPUUS6H6TP62Y\\\\\\">paypal.com/donate/</a></p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"f11fn\\\\\\">Stripe</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dlaqr\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://donate.stripe.com/fZe7uD07z9hAg0w288?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://donate.stripe.com/fZe7uD07z9hAg0w288?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com</a></p><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"6arcc\\\\\\">En liquide ou par ch\\\\u00e8que</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7gjlh\\\\\\">L'association accepte des dons par ch\\\\u00e8que et en liquide. Le plus simple pour les ch\\\\u00e8ques est de les adresser au nom de l'association Les Grands Voisins \\\\u00e0 Chris Mann, 7 place de l'Eglise 92260 FONTENAY-AUX-ROSES ou les amener lors de <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/mission/permanence-le-lundi-entre-10h-et-16h/\\\\\\"><b>nos permanences le lundi de 10h \\\\u00e0 16h</b></a>.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5feff\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.com/fr/contactus?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\"><b>Contactez-nous pour toute question</b></a></p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"bpelk\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/\\\\\\"><b>Les Grands Voisins</b></a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"76eo4\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/mission/\\\\\\"><b>A propos</b></a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2ts4b\\\\\\"><b>Faire un don</b></li></ul>\\", \\"id\\": \\"56b2ab4f-4ae9-4e0c-97f3-789a8a4b1c00\\"}]", "live": false, "path": "000100040002000A", "slug": "faire-un-don", "depth": 4, "owner": 2, "title": "Faire un don", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/association/faire-un-don/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Faire un don", "content_type": 25, "header_image": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": false, "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "845f366c-a97a-43a5-9eb4-0111a6ca460a", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Merci de votre intérêt et vos contributions en temps, en expertise, en matériel, en services ou en numéraire. Vous pouvez […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": null}	\N	201	2	25	1	Faire un don
