549	2024-06-19 14:31:03.812666+02	{"pk": 173, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ukhis\\\\\\">Banya = <b>bain de vapeur</b> russe, dont la temp\\\\u00e9rature et l'hygrom\\\\u00e9trie oscillent entre celles du sauna et celles du hammam.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9s1aq\\\\\\">Le Banya Tour nait de cette pratique traditionnelle du bain d\\\\u00e9plac\\\\u00e9e de la sph\\\\u00e8re intime vers la place publique. Le Tour prend la forme d'une <b>s\\\\u00e9rie de performances</b> qui questionnent le corps dans l'espace public. Chaque performance se r\\\\u00e9invente avec le lieu qui nous accueille, avec les baigneurs.<br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.banyatour.fr/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Continuer la lecture</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"2cf0e1ef-1bce-48db-8beb-19bf2a110f11\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:43:00Z", "live": false, "path": "00010003000A00050007", "slug": "banya-tour", "depth": 5, "owner": 2, "title": "Banya Tour", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/banya-tour/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Banya Tour", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 105, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "10e7055e-0b80-420d-9f39-b18d00ce5501", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Banya = bain de vapeur russe, dont la température et l'hygrométrie oscillent entre celles du sauna et celles du hammam.\\r\\n\\r\\nLe Banya Tour nait de cette pratique traditionnelle du bain déplacée de la sphère intime vers la place publique. Le Tour prend la forme d'une série de performances qui questionnent le corps dans l'espace public. Chaque performance se réinvente avec le lieu qui nous accueille, avec les baigneurs.\\r\\nContinuer la lecture", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-18T13:45:21.694Z"}	\N	173	\N	71	1	Banya Tour
524	2024-06-18 16:08:46.308196+02	{"pk": 162, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"pvn7p\\\\\\">Conseil Handicap &amp; R\\\\u00e9f\\\\u00e9rente handicap Ing\\\\u00e9nieur Responsable P\\\\u00e9dagogique Experte scientifique. Mettez la politique handicap au c\\\\u0153ur de votre RSE!</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"faa8a34f-9a5c-4d23-bb55-15c95e697e5b\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T14:04:00Z", "live": false, "path": "00010002000B0004000O", "slug": "waka-conseil", "depth": 5, "owner": 2, "title": "Waka Conseil", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home/le-village-des-grands-voisins/les-voisins/waka-conseil/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Waka Conseil", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 122, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 523, "translation_key": "4ba24b13-4cc7-47d7-9af2-d1a3d7a23693", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Conseil Handicap & Référente handicap Ingénieur Responsable Pédagogique Experte scientifique. Mettez la politique handicap au cœur de votre RSE!", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-18T14:08:44.059Z"}	\N	162	2	71	1	Waka Conseil
551	2024-06-19 14:31:03.961755+02	{"pk": 174, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1uxf0\\\\\\">Photographer and documentary filmmaker</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1lb2s\\\\\\">Robert Baldridge has worked as a freelance photojournalist for over 40 years. His work has been published in the NYTimes , Vanity Fair, VOGUE , and by other magazines in Europe and South America . His work is in the vain of the concerned photography tradition.<br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge</a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1ramh\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22Robert+%22Bob%22+Baldridge%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Robert \\\\\\"Bob\\\\\\" Baldridge</a> is a long-time Greenwich resident. For years he has used his camera to document his experiences, along with those of others. His work has appeared in Vogue, The <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22New+York+Times+Magazine%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">New York Times Magazine</a> and other publications abroad. He's especially drawn to recording the works-in-progress of other artists. He's documenting actor <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22Matt+Dillon%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Matt Dillon</a>'s philanthropic work centered on a Rwandan doctor in Africa, and he's been documenting the <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22Dalai+Lama%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Dalai Lama</a> and his fellow Tibetans in exile in India.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ebjsm\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/news/article/Local-photographer-sheds-light-on-the-art-of-4768898.php?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com#photo-5117574\\\\\\">https://www.greenwichtime.com/news/article/Local-photographer-sheds-light-on-the-art-of-4768898.php#photo-5117574</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.instagram.com/robertbaldridgeofficial/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.instagram.com/robertbaldridgeofficial/</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?modal=project-1467194&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?modal=project-1467194</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://gmpphoto.blogspot.com/2021/12/lisl-steiner-in-cerro-muriano-cordoba.html?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://gmpphoto.blogspot.com/2021/12/lisl-steiner-in-cerro-muriano-cordoba.html</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"94081c06-5ca7-420c-ab85-2f18d44f3622\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:45:00Z", "live": false, "path": "00010003000A00050008", "slug": "robert-baldridge", "depth": 5, "owner": 2, "title": "Robert Baldridge", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/robert-baldridge/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Robert Baldridge", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 106, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "5efeed0c-1c6d-4179-95ae-a62757d9ecfa", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Photographer and documentary filmmaker\\r\\n\\r\\nRobert Baldridge has worked as a freelance photojournalist for over 40 years. His work has been published in the NYTimes , Vanity Fair, VOGUE , and by other magazines in Europe and South America . His work is in the vain of the concerned photography tradition.\\r\\nhttps://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge\\r\\n\\r\\nRobert \\"Bob\\" Baldridge is a long-time Greenwich resident. For years he has used his camera to document his experiences, along with those of others. His work has appeared in Vogue, The New York Times Magazine and other publications abroad. He's especially drawn to recording the works-in-progress of other artists. He's documenting actor Matt Dillon's philanthropic work centered on a Rwandan doctor in Africa, and he's been documenting the Dalai Lama and his fellow Tibetans in exile in India.\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://www.greenwichtime.com/news/article/Local-photographer-sheds-light-on-the-art-of-4768898.php#photo-5117574\\r\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/robertbaldridgeofficial/\\r\\nhttps://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?modal=project-1467194\\r\\nhttps://gmpphoto.blogspot.com/2021/12/lisl-steiner-in-cerro-muriano-cordoba.html", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-18T13:47:02.078Z"}	\N	174	\N	71	1	Robert Baldridge
552	2024-06-19 14:31:04.003055+02	{"pk": 174, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1uxf0\\\\\\">Photographer and documentary filmmaker</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1lb2s\\\\\\">Robert Baldridge has worked as a freelance photojournalist for over 40 years. His work has been published in the NYTimes , Vanity Fair, VOGUE , and by other magazines in Europe and South America . His work is in the vain of the concerned photography tradition.<br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge</a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1ramh\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22Robert+%22Bob%22+Baldridge%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Robert \\\\\\"Bob\\\\\\" Baldridge</a> is a long-time Greenwich resident. For years he has used his camera to document his experiences, along with those of others. His work has appeared in Vogue, The <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22New+York+Times+Magazine%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">New York Times Magazine</a> and other publications abroad. He's especially drawn to recording the works-in-progress of other artists. He's documenting actor <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22Matt+Dillon%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Matt Dillon</a>'s philanthropic work centered on a Rwandan doctor in Africa, and he's been documenting the <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22Dalai+Lama%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Dalai Lama</a> and his fellow Tibetans in exile in India.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ebjsm\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/news/article/Local-photographer-sheds-light-on-the-art-of-4768898.php?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com#photo-5117574\\\\\\">https://www.greenwichtime.com/news/article/Local-photographer-sheds-light-on-the-art-of-4768898.php#photo-5117574</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.instagram.com/robertbaldridgeofficial/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.instagram.com/robertbaldridgeofficial/</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?modal=project-1467194&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?modal=project-1467194</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://gmpphoto.blogspot.com/2021/12/lisl-steiner-in-cerro-muriano-cordoba.html?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://gmpphoto.blogspot.com/2021/12/lisl-steiner-in-cerro-muriano-cordoba.html</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"94081c06-5ca7-420c-ab85-2f18d44f3622\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:45:00Z", "live": false, "path": "00010003000A00050008", "slug": "robert-baldridge", "depth": 5, "owner": 2, "title": "Robert Baldridge", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/robert-baldridge/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Robert Baldridge", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 106, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 551, "translation_key": "5efeed0c-1c6d-4179-95ae-a62757d9ecfa", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Photographer and documentary filmmaker\\r\\n \\nRobert Baldridge has worked as a freelance photojournalist for over 40 years. His work has been published in the NYTimes , Vanity Fair, VOGUE , and by other magazines in Europe and South America . His work is in the vain of the concerned photography tradition.\\r\\nhttps://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge\\r\\n \\nRobert \\"Bob\\" Baldridge is a long-time Greenwich resident. For years he has used his camera to document his experiences, along with those of others. His work has appeared in Vogue, The New York Times Magazine and other publications abroad. He's especially drawn to recording the works-in-progress of other artists. He's documenting actor Matt Dillon's philanthropic work centered on a Rwandan doctor in Africa, and he's been documenting the Dalai Lama and his fellow Tibetans in exile in India.\\r\\n \\nhttps://www.greenwichtime.com/news/article/Local-photographer-sheds-light-on-the-art-of-4768898.php#photo-5117574\\r\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/robertbaldridgeofficial/\\r\\nhttps://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?modal=project-1467194\\r\\nhttps://gmpphoto.blogspot.com/2021/12/lisl-steiner-in-cerro-muriano-cordoba.html", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-19T12:31:03.961Z"}	\N	174	1	71	1	Robert Baldridge
553	2024-06-19 14:31:04.108732+02	{"pk": 175, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"gqc5e\\\\\\">Denis Decastro</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"du74\\\\\\">Denis de Castro est un chercheur en m\\\\u00e9decine, qui travaillait auparavant, je crois, au CNRS, dans le centre de Paris. Denis vit maintenant \\\\u00e0 Dunedun, en Australie. Avant de prendre sa retraite, Denis traitait des donn\\\\u00e9es volumineuses en langage R et faisait des blagues, apportant de la lumi\\\\u00e8re \\\\u00e0 son \\\\u00e9quipe de recherche. Aujourd'hui, Denis est un contributeur important de Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"87bn5\\\\\\">Denis de Castro is a medical research scientist, previously I think with the CNRS in central Paris. Denis now lives in Dunedun Australia. Prior to retirement, Denis processed big data in R-languages and made jokes, bringing light to his research team. Today, Denis is a significant contributor to Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2e40h\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://auckland.academia.edu/DenisdeCastro?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Academia.edu</a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"32uv4\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.researchgate.net/scientific-contributions/Denis-de-Castro-33850121?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Researchgate</a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5qm44\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://flaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">flaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com</a><br/></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"8knt\\\\\\">Email</li></ul>\\", \\"id\\": \\"2b93b62d-b019-4a9b-a438-ba97546874d0\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:47:00Z", "live": false, "path": "00010003000A00050009", "slug": "bmcp-bio-medical-consulting-paris-also-aukland-and-dunedin", "depth": 5, "owner": 2, "title": "BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/bmcp-bio-medical-consulting-paris-also-aukland-and-dunedin/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 107, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "4dc52cb9-7c1c-4a68-adf0-490f07a1e9fb", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Denis Decastro\\r\\n\\r\\nDenis de Castro est un chercheur en médecine, qui travaillait auparavant, je crois, au CNRS, dans le centre de Paris. Denis vit maintenant à Dunedun, en Australie. Avant de prendre sa retraite, Denis traitait des données volumineuses en langage R et faisait des blagues, apportant de la lumière à son équipe de recherche. Aujourd'hui, Denis est un contributeur important de Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.\\r\\n\\r\\nDenis de Castro is a medical research scientist, previously I think with the CNRS in central Paris. Denis now lives in Dunedun Australia. Prior to retirement, Denis processed big data in R-languages and made jokes, bringing light to his research team. Today, Denis is a significant contributor to Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.\\r\\n\\r\\nAcademia.edu\\r\\nResearchgate\\r\\nflaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\r\\nEmail", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-18T13:48:45.010Z"}	\N	175	\N	71	1	BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)
555	2024-06-19 14:31:04.240604+02	{"pk": 176, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"sox17\\\\\\">DES LIEUX \\\\u201cBREASTFEEDING FRIENDLY\\\\u201d \\\\u00c0 PORT\\\\u00c9E DE MAIN<br/>Coffee shops, salons de th\\\\u00e9, \\\\u00e9tablissements de petites restaurations, lieux alternatifs,\\\\u2026 affichant une politique explicitement favorable \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019allaitement pourront \\\\u00eatre facilement g\\\\u00e9olocalisables et identifiables.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dgcmo\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://breastfreedom.com/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Breastfreedom.com</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"41e335ce-52fa-476e-a4ee-fee44c20c750\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:48:00Z", "live": false, "path": "00010003000A0005000A", "slug": "breast-freedom", "depth": 5, "owner": 2, "title": "Breast Freedom", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/breast-freedom/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Breast Freedom", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 108, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "83a98f28-f386-41fd-841d-1246216cb019", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "DES LIEUX “BREASTFEEDING FRIENDLY” À PORTÉE DE MAIN\\r\\nCoffee shops, salons de thé, établissements de petites restaurations, lieux alternatifs,… affichant une politique explicitement favorable à l’allaitement pourront être facilement géolocalisables et identifiables.\\r\\n\\r\\nBreastfreedom.com", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-18T13:49:47.359Z"}	\N	176	\N	71	1	Breast Freedom
1008	2024-07-01 19:23:13.414558+02	{"pk": 135, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"imageandtext\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 26, \\"image_side\\": \\"right\\", \\"image_ratio\\": \\"5\\", \\"text\\": \\"<h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"npe8k\\\\\\">Permanence le lundi 12h \\\\u00e0 17h</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d5dqj\\\\\\">Venez \\\\u00e0 notre permanence <b>le lundi de 12h \\\\u00e0 17h</b><br/>en personne \\\\u00e0 <b>93 ave. Du G\\\\u00e9n. Leclerc</b> 75014 Paris (M\\\\u00e9tro Al\\\\u00e9sia, Atelier de la Ressourcerie, <i>7e boutique sur la gauche</i>) ou <a href=\\\\\\"https://meet.lesgrandsvoisins.com/\\\\\\">meet.lesgrandsvoisins.com pour participer en hybride</a>.</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"e6f8d\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/numerique/numerique-creatif/sociabilite-numerique/\\\\\\"><b>Sociabilit\\\\u00e9 num\\\\u00e9rique le lundi de 17h \\\\u00e0 21h30</b></a></h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8ibv4\\\\\\"><b>Le lundi de 17h \\\\u00e0 21h30</b> se tient un atelier d\\\\u2019entraide num\\\\u00e9rique \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019Atelier au <b>93 ave. du G\\\\u00e9n. Leclerc 75014 PARIS</b> \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9rieur du <i>centre commercial 7e boutique sur la gauche</i></p>\\", \\"link\\": {\\"page\\": 134, \\"external_url\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"Voir les salles de sociabilit\\\\u00e9 num\\\\u00e9rique\\"}, \\"link_label\\": \\"\\", \\"page\\": null, \\"link_url\\": \\"\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"d6c35ae0-a766-40aa-87f3-2d92b57fb2fb\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"imageandtext\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 93, \\"image_side\\": \\"left\\", \\"image_ratio\\": \\"6\\", \\"text\\": \\"<h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"cw46c\\\\\\">22e Conseil des Voisins du 10 au 16 juin 2024</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8s1t0\\\\\\">\\\\ud83c\\\\udf1f <b>Venez co-constuire un voisinage</b> \\\\ud83c\\\\udf1f</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"f2jog\\\\\\"><i>anim\\\\u00e9, chic, vivant,partageant, \\\\u00e9quip\\\\u00e9,ressour\\\\u00e7ant, respectueux,mondial, multiculturel,prosp\\\\u00e8re, et de proximit\\\\u00e9.</i></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fp0p9\\\\\\">Nous tiendrions le 22e Conseil des Voisins sur trois rencontres :</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"7ohgo\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/les-grands-voisins/evenements/les-grands-voisins\\\\\\">Lundi le 10 juin de 19h45 \\\\u00e0 21h25</a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"csdek\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/les-grands-voisins/evenements/les-grands-voisins-1\\\\\\">Jeudi le 13 juin de 15h15 \\\\u00e0 16h45</a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"aso3g\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.helloasso.com/associations/les-grands-voisins/evenements/les-grands-voisins-2\\\\\\">Samedi le le 15 juin de 10h15 \\\\u00e0 11h45</a></li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"f20hj\\\\\\">Ordre du jour :</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"boa4d\\\\\\">Num\\\\u00e9rique</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"1khco\\\\\\">\\\\u00c9ventuellement Civisme</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"d1unh\\\\\\">Communication</li></ol>\\", \\"link\\": {\\"page\\": 50, \\"external_url\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"Venez co-constuire un voisinage lors du 22e Conseil des voisins.\\"}, \\"link_label\\": \\"\\", \\"page\\": null, \\"link_url\\": \\"\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"609eb7c0-f102-4cf1-b302-04cef750054f\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"2rlrq\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://list.lesgrandsvoisins.com/subscription/form\\\\\\"><b><i>Pensez \\\\u00e0 vous inscrire sur notre liste d'infos !</i></b></a></h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"c046k\\\\\\">Nous sommes une association d'int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat g\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9ral agissant de mani\\\\u00e8re contr\\\\u00f4l\\\\u00e9e en subsidiarit\\\\u00e9 ouverte pour toute organisation et tout individu qui en fait la d\\\\u00e9cision pour soi-m\\\\u00eame principalement en ces trois domaines <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/communautes/\\\\\\">de Discussions</a>, <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/arts/\\\\\\">d'Arts plastiques</a> et <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/numerique/\\\\\\">de Num\\\\u00e9rique</a> selon <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/mission/\\\\\\">notre d\\\\u00e9claration de mission</a>.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8nof2\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/communautes/\\\\\\"><b>Civisme</b></a> :</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"4dfni\\\\\\">Nous proposons des conditions encourageant la compr\\\\u00e9hension entre individus et organisations de perspectives diff\\\\u00e9rentes.</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"3ormf\\\\\\">Nous ouvrons notre gouvernance pour des votes en Conseils des Voisins.</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"51nl6\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/arts/\\\\\\"><b>Arts plastiques</b></a> :</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"1c45a\\\\\\">Nous encourageons l\\\\u2019utilisation hybrides d\\\\u2019espace (commerces, h\\\\u00f4pitaux, caf\\\\u00e9s, etc.) aussi en gall\\\\u00e9ries locales.</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"97vmp\\\\\\">Nous accompagnons des institutions pour trouver une juste place pour les arts plastiques dans leurs locaux.</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"f50ea\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr/numerique/\\\\\\"><b>Num\\\\u00e9rique</b></a> :</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5gvr6\\\\\\">Nous maintenons une constellation de serveurs et de services internet -- tableau de bord, cr\\\\u00e9ation et gestion de compte, courriel, rencontres hybrides pr\\\\u00e9sence-distance, listes de diffusion num\\\\u00e9riques, blogs, serveurs webs, gestionnaire de mot de passe, enregistrement dans le nuage, forums de discussion, gestion de la connaissance, \\\\u00e9dition markdown, wikis, \\\\u00e9dition bueautique, etc. -- pour, par, et de nous-m\\\\u00eames et d'autres.</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"emg6m\\\\\\">Nous mettons \\\\u00e0 disposition des talents et des mat\\\\u00e9riaux dans des salles de sociabilit\\\\u00e9 num\\\\u00e9rique et dans des syst\\\\u00e8mes de pr\\\\u00eats et \\\\u00e9changes de mat\\\\u00e9riels \\\\u00e0 l'attention d'individus et d'organisations de tous niveaux.</li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9n2mc\\\\\\">Voici quelques entit\\\\u00e9s Grandes Voisines qui soutiennent notre d\\\\u00e9marche: A Good Solution, Banya Tour, Robert Baldridge, BMCP, Breast Freedom, Le Bureau du Cr\\\\u00e9ateur, Le Chiffon, Les Jardins du Num\\\\u00e9rique, Olivier Duhec, Inno Cube, Caroline Lhomme, Francesco du 59 Rivoli, Amadou Gaye, Informatruck, Inolib, KaceKode, Ada Matus, L\\\\u2019Odys\\\\u00e9e, La Ressourcerie Cr\\\\u00e9ative, Henry Roy, Peter Vaeth, Waka Conseil, Weezem, et peut-\\\\u00eatre des v\\\\u00f4tres \\\\u2026</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fgqkl\\\\\\">Pour plus d\\\\u2019informations, contactez-nous\\\\u00a0:</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ff18b\\\\\\">bienvenue@lesgrandsvoisins.com</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"26hsg\\\\\\">+33 7 81 811 811</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5q99f\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.village.ngo/en/activites/civisme/\\\\\\">Civisme</a> - <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.village.ngo/en/activites/arts-plastiques/\\\\\\">Arts plastiques</a> - <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.village.ngo/en/activites/numerique/\\\\\\">Num\\\\u00e9rique</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"2b04bc61-d040-4232-adff-b8a82cc25497\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "00010004", "slug": "le-village-des-grands-voisins", "depth": 2, "owner": 1, "title": "Les Grands Voisins", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 6, "sections": "[]", "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Les Grands Voisins", "content_type": 87, "header_image": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": 1007, "show_in_menus": false, "section_1_body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"multicolumns\\", \\"value\\": {\\"bg_image\\": null, \\"bg_color_class\\": \\"\\", \\"bg_color\\": \\"\\", \\"title\\": \\"\\", \\"heading_tag\\": \\"h2\\", \\"columns\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"value\\": \\"<h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"w1uv4\\\\\\">Les Grands Voisins / VillageNgo<br/><b><i>L'Autre</i></b><i> est une chance.</i></h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6fefc\\\\\\">Nous co-construisons un voisinage compl\\\\u00e9mentaire aux voisinages existants.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6bci7\\\\\\">Dans notre village, vous trouverez des Grands Voisins de toutes les cat\\\\u00e9gories collectives -- associations, entreprises, institutions publics, services sociaux, promoteurs grands publics, etc. -- et individuelles : artistes, artisans, professionnels, demandeurs d'emploi, avec ou sans papiers, salari\\\\u00e9s, ind\\\\u00e9pendants, etc ; puis vous trouverez des individus dans toutes nos richesses : un individu une voix.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"aq1jh\\\\\\">Notre association coop\\\\u00e9rative se propose aussi de montrer l'exemple par des activit\\\\u00e9s propres en civisme, en arts plastiques et en num\\\\u00e9rique. Cela dit, notre mission premi\\\\u00e8re est dans la subsidiarit\\\\u00e9; nous la recherchons toujours et partout.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"b326d84c-6f90-4cb2-992a-718d65198627\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"video\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"La cit\\\\u00e9 r\\\\u00eav\\\\u00e9e\\", \\"caption\\": \\"Les Grands Voisins, la cit\\\\u00e9 r\\\\u00eav\\\\u00e9e filme documentaire long-m\\\\u00e9trage pass\\\\u00e9 dans les salles en 2020\\", \\"url\\": \\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qZqErGfNF_o\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"ce39e208-107d-4c71-af8c-0e04d024d259\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"a786ba6e-81eb-4111-a58d-24313d175753\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"imageandtext\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 161, \\"image_side\\": \\"left\\", \\"image_ratio\\": \\"5\\", \\"text\\": \\"<h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"2llg8\\\\\\">Agenda</h2><h3 data-block-key=\\\\\\"5gnbv\\\\\\">F\\\\u00eate de la fermeture du CHU Emma\\\\u00fcs Solidarit\\\\u00e9</h3><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4r14g\\\\\\">50 bd Jourdan 75014 PARIS</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"716i3\\\\\\">mercredi le 3 juillet</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2mmqp\\\\\\">14h \\\\u00e0 16h : Repas des Mamans</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"845q\\\\\\">16h \\\\u00e0 17h : Contes</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"e8adl\\\\\\">17h et apr\\\\u00e8s : Concerts avec de multiples artistes</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"etbi6\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.village.ngo/medias/images/fete-cloture-emmaus-20204.original.png\\\\\\">Affiche</a></p>\\", \\"link\\": {\\"page\\": null, \\"external_url\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"\\"}, \\"link_label\\": \\"\\", \\"page\\": null, \\"link_url\\": \\"\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"ad7f3b8e-10f7-4643-ad1a-d7a41cdf2126\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"multicolumns\\", \\"value\\": {\\"bg_image\\": null, \\"bg_color_class\\": \\"\\", \\"bg_color\\": \\"\\", \\"title\\": \\"Activit\\\\u00e9s\\", \\"heading_tag\\": \\"h2\\", \\"columns\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"card\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Civisme\\", \\"description\\": \\"Nous nous proposons en tant \\\\u00ab qu'association coop\\\\u00e9rative d'int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat public \\\\u00bb. Cela fait que nous d\\\\u00e9cidons comme si nous \\\\u00e9tions une coop\\\\u00e9rative, sauf que tous nos services sont de, par et pour tous nos usagers. Nous nous appliquons alors des principes de transparence et d\\\\u2019ind\\\\u00e9pendance forts.\\", \\"image\\": 45, \\"url\\": \\"https://www.village.ngo/fr/activit%C3%A9s/civisme/\\", \\"document\\": null}, \\"id\\": \\"48217c4e-c6d5-4069-9d65-2095e6e8716d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"card\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Arts plastiques\\", \\"description\\": \\"Nous encourageons les artistes et les commer\\\\u00e7ants locaux \\\\u00e0 faire des popup expos, soutenons les artistes plasticiens et pr\\\\u00e9voyons d'organiser une vente aux ench\\\\u00e8res\\", \\"image\\": 50, \\"url\\": \\"https://www.village.ngo/fr/activit%C3%A9s/arts-plastiques/\\", \\"document\\": null}, \\"id\\": \\"c566bf79-f05e-4bf6-bdf1-df752d4d6cb7\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"card\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Num\\\\u00e9rique\\", \\"description\\": \\"Pouss\\\\u00e9s par la Mission des Grands Voisins et le Contrat pour le Web, nous avan\\\\u00e7ons avec assurance dans le num\\\\u00e9rique interd\\\\u00e9pendant et autonome des Grands Voisins par le d\\\\u00e9veloppement de salles de sociabilit\\\\u00e9 num\\\\u00e9riques, des partages de mat\\\\u00e9riaux entre structures, et des constellations de serveurs et de services.\\", \\"image\\": 49, \\"url\\": \\"https://www.village.ngo/fr/activit%C3%A9s/numerique/\\", \\"document\\": null}, \\"id\\": \\"c337e1a5-bc00-4651-9785-9761554cfe0a\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"e7581eeb-45bd-4c0d-949a-1f744d68225f\\"}]", "section_2_body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"imageandtext\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 96, \\"image_side\\": \\"right\\", \\"image_ratio\\": \\"5\\", \\"text\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dkeo3\\\\\\">UN VOISINAGE COMPL\\\\u00c9MENTAIRE</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"33a8d\\\\\\"><b>Des structures et collectifs</b></h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"30oc5\\\\\\">Les structures sont les canaux d\\\\u2019action \\\\u00e0 travers l\\\\u2019association coop\\\\u00e9rative d\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat public. Les structures peuvent \\\\u00eatre des associations, des entreprises, des professionnels, des artistes, des artisans, des collectifs, des services sociaux, ou des institutions publiques. Nous souhaitons fournir un soutien aux structures selon le principe de subsidiarit\\\\u00e9 et selon la volont\\\\u00e9 des individus. Une structure ou communaut\\\\u00e9 peut comprendre plusieurs individus.</p>\\", \\"link\\": {\\"page\\": null, \\"external_url\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"\\"}, \\"link_label\\": \\"\\", \\"page\\": null, \\"link_url\\": \\"\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"6563f8da-4a7e-493b-8358-9e51f4352c1f\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"imageandtext\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 97, \\"image_side\\": \\"left\\", \\"image_ratio\\": \\"5\\", \\"text\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dkeo3\\\\\\">QUI SONT GRANDS VOISINS QUI VEULENT BIEN</p><h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"19cun\\\\\\"><b>Association gouvern\\\\u00e9e par vous</b></h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"41mcs\\\\\\">Les individus gouvernent Les Grands Voisins. Les individus comprennent et d\\\\u00e9cident individuellement. Toute personne physique qui le souhaite, par seule sa propre volont\\\\u00e9, est membre votant des Grands Voisins. Seulement les individus (pas les structures) votent dans les Conseils des Grands Voisins. Nous sommes transparents pour tout individu qui souhaite des informations que nous pouvons fournir. Chaque individu peut faire partie d'une ou plusieurs structures ou communaut\\\\u00e9s.</p>\\", \\"link\\": {\\"page\\": null, \\"external_url\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"\\"}, \\"link_label\\": \\"\\", \\"page\\": null, \\"link_url\\": \\"\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"4dda2eb2-baa1-48df-be54-f7ecdee02f9a\\"}]", "section_3_body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"accordions\\", \\"value\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"title\\", \\"value\\": \\"Les Grands Voisins\\", \\"id\\": \\"1c93f2da-7ff6-4f28-9ca0-f47d778816d1\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"accordion\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Quels sont les sites webs de l'association Les Grands Voisins ?\\", \\"content\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9a1ky\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.fr\\\\\\">LesGrandsVoisins.fr</a> : Le site public principal des Grands Voisins</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ejt7u\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.resdigita.com\\\\\\">ResDigita.com</a> : Le num\\\\u00e9rique des Grands Voisins se nomme ResDigita.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8tu6\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Blog.LesGrandsVoisins.com</a> : Notre blog (accessible depuis le site principal)</p>\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"48f40f9e-a2a1-4689-8e88-748e6be1672d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"accordion\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Quels sont les m\\\\u00e9dias sociaux de l'association ?\\", \\"content\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9a1ky\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.instagram.com/les_grands_voisins/\\\\\\">Instagram@les_grands_voisins</a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"eoa6g\\\\\\">Facebook</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"pdij\\\\\\">LinkedIn</p>\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"ebf17063-1f73-4f98-851a-d8324c7a4de3\\"}], \\"id\\": \\"d706e793-1ea0-4eb3-a841-21fe72ea3dad\\"}]", "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 1007, "translation_key": "b503fd04-9007-4d34-b340-c45938c9bcd4", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-07-01T17:22:48.902Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-09T08:35:47.374Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Sociabilité numérique le lundi de 17h à 21h30 Le lundi de 17h à 21h30 se tient un atelier d’entraide numérique […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-07-01T17:22:48.875Z", "section_2_description_rich": "<p data-block-key=\\"hrhup\\">Notre village est construit d'acteurs socio-économiques et d'individus. Nous nous trouvons toutes et tous à l'intersection de ces deux concepts. Bien que dans le village, nous voyons d'abord les entités -- personnes physiques et personnes morales -- nous décidons pour une bonne partie en personnes individuelles et consciencieuses, en grands voisins selon la définition subjective de chacune et de chacun de ce que c'est être grande voisine ou être grand voisin.</p>"}	\N	135	1	87	1	Les Grands Voisins
623	2024-06-19 16:54:38.899946+02	{"pk": 152, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4g1jt\\\\\\">Artisan d\\\\u2019art, dipl\\\\u00f4m\\\\u00e9 de l\\\\u2019\\\\u00c9cole Boulle en 1999, Olivier Duhec a pass\\\\u00e9 dix ann\\\\u00e9es \\\\u00e0 se perfectionner dans le travail du m\\\\u00e9tal chez des cr\\\\u00e9ateurs parmi les plus prestigieux, dont Jean Perzel qui a beaucoup influenc\\\\u00e9 son travail.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fbkgd\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/caroline-lhomme?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">DuHec.Art.</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"075cb964-b027-4743-a1fd-bb92f483510d\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:53:00Z", "live": true, "path": "000100040005000E", "slug": "olivier-duhec", "depth": 4, "owner": 2, "title": "Olivier DUHEC", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/olivier-duhec/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Olivier DUHEC", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 112, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": 504, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [1], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 622, "translation_key": "a1c5428b-15bb-4191-8675-beef434858a8", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": "2024-06-18T13:54:38.988Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-18T13:54:38.988Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Artisan d’art, diplômé de l’École Boulle en 1999, Olivier Duhec a passé dix années à se perfectionner dans le travail du métal chez des créateurs parmi les plus prestigieux, dont Jean Perzel qui a beaucoup influencé son travail.\\r\\n\\r\\nDuHec.Art.", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-19T14:54:36.060Z"}	\N	152	2	71	1	Olivier DUHEC
1036	2024-07-05 10:07:31.521751+02	{"pk": 249, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1xpvh\\\\\\">Cette page est en cours de r\\\\u00e9daction.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"c48af3ba-b2da-42a5-b5fc-92259aecc4cd\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"uqnwb\\\\\\">Nous sommes une association d'int\\\\u00e9r\\\\u00eat g\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9ral inspir\\\\u00e9 de notre mission de 2017</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"endph\\\\\\">pour construire une voisinage compl\\\\u00e9mentaire aux voisinages existants</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9qmsj\\\\\\">o\\\\u00f9 vous trouverez dans notre village des acteurs socio-\\\\u00e9conomiques individuels et collectifs de tous types</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9dh83\\\\\\">-- artisans, artistes, associations, demandeurs d'emploi, entreprises, \\\\u00e9tudiants, ind\\\\u00e9pendants, institutions publiques, mineurs, personnes marginalis\\\\u00e9es, rentiers, retrait\\\\u00e9s, salari\\\\u00e9s, sans papiers, etc. --</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5dcju\\\\\\">gouvern\\\\u00e9e en fonctionnement coop\\\\u00e9ratif o\\\\u00f9 les votes sont attribu\\\\u00e9s aux individus</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"c0ohm\\\\\\">et o\\\\u00f9 nous nous concentrons pour aujourd'hui dans trois domaines : Civisme, Arts plastiques et num\\\\u00e9rique.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"ce73b95b-407e-4b12-88f7-6f4945d11d81\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "000100040002000B", "slug": "presentation", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "Présentation de l'association", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/association/presentation/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Présentation de l'association", "content_type": 25, "header_image": 5, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": 1033, "show_in_menus": true, "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 1033, "translation_key": "37928d62-a6d7-4190-8c6f-816fdd6db7d4", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-07-05T07:57:38.780Z", "first_published_at": "2024-07-05T07:56:57.771Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Nous sommes une association d'intérêt général agissant de manière contrôlée en subsidiarité ouverte pour toute organisation et tout individu qui en fait la décision pour soi-même principalement en ces trois domaines de Discussions, d'Arts plastiques et de Numérique selon notre déclaration de mission.", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-07-05T07:57:38.759Z"}	\N	249	1	25	1	Présentation de l'association
557	2024-06-19 14:31:04.370133+02	{"pk": 177, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"vqswo\\\\\\">Accompagnement de cr\\\\u00e9ateurs et d'artistes</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"42ou0\\\\\\">Sp\\\\u00e9cialis\\\\u00e9s dans les march\\\\u00e9s de l'art et la cr\\\\u00e9ation, nous vous apportons notre vision du monde et notre expertise pour vous aider \\\\u00e0 voir plus loin, plus grand.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3lnrf\\\\\\">A trouver la meilleure version de vous-m\\\\u00eame et les meilleurs march\\\\u00e9s pour vendre et vivre de vos cr\\\\u00e9ations.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"aqqc0\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://lebureauducreateur.fr/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">LeBureauDuCreateur.fr</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"d1c61fdf-3ff0-4e74-828e-021d3a663803\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:49:00Z", "live": false, "path": "00010003000A0005000B", "slug": "le-bureau-du-créateur", "depth": 5, "owner": 2, "title": "Le Bureau du Créateur", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/le-bureau-du-créateur/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Le Bureau du Créateur", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 109, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "ba1f0597-c89e-42d0-ae66-7bb74d77128d", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Accompagnement de créateurs et d'artistes\\r\\nSpécialisés dans les marchés de l'art et la création, nous vous apportons notre vision du monde et notre expertise pour vous aider à voir plus loin, plus grand.\\r\\n\\r\\nA trouver la meilleure version de vous-même et les meilleurs marchés pour vendre et vivre de vos créations.\\r\\n\\r\\nLeBureauDuCreateur.fr", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-18T13:51:43.927Z"}	\N	177	\N	71	1	Le Bureau du Créateur
