nt une politique explicitement favorable à l’allaitement pourront être facilement géolocalisables et identifiables.\\r\\n\\r\\nBreastfreedom.com", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-20T13:52:41.616Z"}	\N	148	2	71	1	Breast Freedom
734	2024-06-20 16:12:19.770224+02	{"pk": 193, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2pytq\\\\\\">Merci de voter pour les 21e et 22e Conseils des Voisins !</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"55sdc\\\\\\">Dans notre association, nous servons les tout statut socio-\\\\u00e9conomique individuel ou collectif -- les artistes, les artisans, les associations, les entreprises, les salari\\\\u00e9s, les demandeurs d'emploi, les institutions, les services sociaux, ... -- mais ce sont les individus r\\\\u00e9partis dans trois coll\\\\u00e8ges qui d\\\\u00e9cident.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7tb7a\\\\\\">Lors de nos 21e et 22e Conseils des Voisins, nous avons propos\\\\u00e9 des d\\\\u00e9cisions \\\\u00e0 prendre. Dans ce formulaire, vous avez la possibilit\\\\u00e9 de voter pour les propositions.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"48955129-b0a0-4ee3-ba3a-b9b51c72a2c4\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "00010004000200040001", "slug": "votes-21", "depth": 5, "intro": "", "owner": 1, "title": "Votes pour les 21e Conseil des Voisins", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "subject": "Vote des 21e et 22e Conseils des Voisins", "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/association/conseils-des-voisins/votes-22-1/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "to_address": "chris@village.ngo", "draft_title": "Votes pour les 21e et 22e Conseils des Voisins", "form_fields": [{"pk": 1, "page": 193, "label": "Prénom", "choices": "", "required": true, "help_text": "", "clean_name": "prenom", "field_type": "singleline", "sort_order": 0, "default_value": ""}, {"pk": 2, "page": 193, "label": "Nom de famille", "choices": "", "required": true, "help_text": "", "clean_name": "nom", "field_type": "singleline", "sort_order": 1, "default_value": ""}, {"pk": 3, "page": 193, "label": "Email", "choices": "", "required": true, "help_text": "", "clean_name": "email", "field_type": "email", "sort_order": 2, "default_value": ""}, {"pk": 4, "page": 193, "label": "21-Admin-1 : Pré-approuver Comptes", "choices": "Oui\\r\\nNon\\r\\nAbstention\\r\\nVote déjà enregistré ou vote à venir plus tard", "required": true, "help_text": "Les comptes simplifiés sont présentés avec les informations suivantes: recettes de 1200 euros et dépenses de 2000 euros. Les comptes détaillés seront présentés prochainement. Validez-vous ces données pour les comptes à venir ?", "clean_name": "administratif_pre_approuver_comptes", "field_type": "radio", "sort_order": 3, "default_value": "Vote déjà enregistré ou vote à venir plus tard"}, {"pk": null, "page": 193, "label": "21-Admin-2 : Salaire 70% SMIC Chris MANN", "choices": "Oui\\r\\nNon\\r\\nAbstention\\r\\nVote déjà enregistré ou vote à venir plus tard", "required": true, "help_text": "En ligne avec la décision de l'AG de lancement des Grands Voisins en novembre 2022, validez-vous le principe toujours de rémunérer Chris MANN  70% du SMIC à partir du moment où l'association peut payer le salaire et permettez une modification statutaire ?", "clean_name": "", "field_type": "radio", "sort_order": 4, "default_value": "Vote déjà enregistré ou vote à venir plus tard"}, {"pk": null, "page": 193, "label": "21-Admin-3 : Présentation de comptes et de budget", "choices": "Oui\\r\\nNon\\r\\nAbstention\\r\\nVote déjà enregistré ou vote à venir plus tard", "required": true, "help_text": "L'association présentera lors d'un prochain Conseil les Comptes et le Budget de manière formelles", "clean_name": "", "field_type": "radio", "sort_order": 5, "default_value": "Vote déjà enregistré ou vote à venir plus tard"}, {"pk": null, "page": 193, "label": "21-Admin-4 : Demandes de subventions à la Ville de Paris", "choices": "Oui\\r\\nNon\\r\\nAbstention\\r\\nVote déjà enregistré ou vote à venir plus tard", "required": true, "help_text": "Le BPP 2022 est investi dans l'atelier de la Ressourcerie créative. Validez-vous les 4 demandes de subventionnement de nov. 2023 et les quatre demandes de subventionnement de mai 2024 à la Ville de Paris ?", "clean_name": "", "field_type": "radio", "sort_order": 6, "default_value": "Vote déjà enregistré ou vote à venir plus tard"}, {"pk": null, "page": 193, "label": "21-ADMIN-5 : Paiement stagiaire", "choices": "Oui\\r\\nNon\\r\\nAbstention\\r\\nVote déjà enregistré ou vote à venir plus tard", "required": true, "help_text": "Validez-vous 1215 euros nets sous réserve de subvention de fonctionnement hors projets d'au moins le double (2430 euros) pour un stage à temps plien du 21 mai au 20 juillet 2024 (éventuellement adjustable pro-rata) ?.", "clean_name": "", "field_type": "radio", "sort_order": 7, "default_value": "Vote déjà enregistré ou vote à venir plus tard"}, {"pk": null, "page": 193, "label": "21-ART-1 : Responsable arts plastiques Marine MESSIER", "choices": "Oui\\r\\nNon\\r\\nAbstention\\r\\nVote déjà enregistré ou vote à venir plus tard", "required": true, "help_text": "Validez-vous Marine MESSIER du Bureau du créateur comme responsable des activités artistiques ? (Démission au début du 22e Conseil)", "clean_name": "", "field_type": "radio", "sort_order": 8, "default_value": "Vote déjà enregistré ou vote à venir plus tard"}], "content_type": 91, "from_address": "chris@village.ngo", "header_image": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": 652, "show_in_menus": true, "thank_you_text": "<p data-block-key=\\"fd7qo\\">Merci, nous aurions pris pris compte de vos votes !</p>", "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 728, "translation_key": "1cab700e-e8bc-4319-8ddb-5c2001a41470", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-06-20T11:49:45.208Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-20T11:33:24.701Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-20T14:09:19.730Z"}	\N	193	1	91	1	Votes pour les 21e Conseil des Voisins
563	2024-06-19 14:31:04.744894+02	{"pk": 180, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4g1jt\\\\\\">Artisan d\\\\u2019art, dipl\\\\u00f4m\\\\u00e9 de l\\\\u2019\\\\u00c9cole Boulle en 1999, Olivier Duhec a pass\\\\u00e9 dix ann\\\\u00e9es \\\\u00e0 se perfectionner dans le travail du m\\\\u00e9tal chez des cr\\\\u00e9ateurs parmi les plus prestigieux, dont Jean Perzel qui a beaucoup influenc\\\\u00e9 son travail.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fbkgd\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/caroline-lhomme?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">DuHec.Art.</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"075cb964-b027-4743-a1fd-bb92f483510d\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:53:00Z", "live": false, "path": "00010003000A0005000E", "slug": "olivier-duhec", "depth": 5, "owner": 2, "title": "Olivier DUHEC", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/olivier-duhec/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Olivier DUHEC", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 112, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "a1c5428b-15bb-4191-8675-beef434858a8", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Artisan d’art, diplômé de l’École Boulle en 1999, Olivier Duhec a passé dix années à se perfectionner dans le travail du métal chez des créateurs parmi les plus prestigieux, dont Jean Perzel qui a beaucoup influencé son travail.\\r\\n\\r\\nDuHec.Art.", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-18T13:54:38.968Z"}	\N	180	\N	71	1	Olivier DUHEC
564	2024-06-19 14:31:04.782111+02	{"pk": 180, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4g1jt\\\\\\">Artisan d\\\\u2019art, dipl\\\\u00f4m\\\\u00e9 de l\\\\u2019\\\\u00c9cole Boulle en 1999, Olivier Duhec a pass\\\\u00e9 dix ann\\\\u00e9es \\\\u00e0 se perfectionner dans le travail du m\\\\u00e9tal chez des cr\\\\u00e9ateurs parmi les plus prestigieux, dont Jean Perzel qui a beaucoup influenc\\\\u00e9 son travail.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fbkgd\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/caroline-lhomme?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">DuHec.Art.</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"075cb964-b027-4743-a1fd-bb92f483510d\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:53:00Z", "live": false, "path": "00010003000A0005000E", "slug": "olivier-duhec", "depth": 5, "owner": 2, "title": "Olivier DUHEC", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/olivier-duhec/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Olivier DUHEC", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 112, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 563, "translation_key": "a1c5428b-15bb-4191-8675-beef434858a8", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Artisan d’art, diplômé de l’École Boulle en 1999, Olivier Duhec a passé dix années à se perfectionner dans le travail du métal chez des créateurs parmi les plus prestigieux, dont Jean Perzel qui a beaucoup influencé son travail.\\r\\n \\nDuHec.Art.", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-19T12:31:04.744Z"}	\N	180	1	71	1	Olivier DUHEC
635	2024-06-19 16:56:21.180064+02	{"pk": 146, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1uxf0\\\\\\">Photographer and documentary filmmaker</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1lb2s\\\\\\">Robert Baldridge has worked as a freelance photojournalist for over 40 years. His work has been published in the NYTimes , Vanity Fair, VOGUE , and by other magazines in Europe and South America . His work is in the vain of the concerned photography tradition.<br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge</a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1ramh\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22Robert+%22Bob%22+Baldridge%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Robert \\\\\\"Bob\\\\\\" Baldridge</a> is a long-time Greenwich resident. For years he has used his camera to document his experiences, along with those of others. His work has appeared in Vogue, The <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22New+York+Times+Magazine%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">New York Times Magazine</a> and other publications abroad. He's especially drawn to recording the works-in-progress of other artists. He's documenting actor <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22Matt+Dillon%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Matt Dillon</a>'s philanthropic work centered on a Rwandan doctor in Africa, and he's been documenting the <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/search/?action=search&amp;channel=news&amp;inlineLink=1&amp;searchindex=solr&amp;query=%22Dalai+Lama%22&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Dalai Lama</a> and his fellow Tibetans in exile in India.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ebjsm\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.greenwichtime.com/news/article/Local-photographer-sheds-light-on-the-art-of-4768898.php?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com#photo-5117574\\\\\\">https://www.greenwichtime.com/news/article/Local-photographer-sheds-light-on-the-art-of-4768898.php#photo-5117574</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.instagram.com/robertbaldridgeofficial/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.instagram.com/robertbaldridgeofficial/</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?modal=project-1467194&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?modal=project-1467194</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://gmpphoto.blogspot.com/2021/12/lisl-steiner-in-cerro-muriano-cordoba.html?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://gmpphoto.blogspot.com/2021/12/lisl-steiner-in-cerro-muriano-cordoba.html</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"94081c06-5ca7-420c-ab85-2f18d44f3622\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:45:00Z", "live": true, "path": "0001000400050008", "slug": "robert-baldridge", "depth": 4, "owner": 2, "title": "Robert Baldridge", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/robert-baldridge/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Robert Baldridge", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 106, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": 492, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [1], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 634, "translation_key": "5efeed0c-1c6d-4179-95ae-a62757d9ecfa", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": "2024-06-18T13:47:02.103Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-18T13:47:02.103Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Photographer and documentary filmmaker\\r\\n\\r\\nRobert Baldridge has worked as a freelance photojournalist for over 40 years. His work has been published in the NYTimes , Vanity Fair, VOGUE , and by other magazines in Europe and South America . His work is in the vain of the concerned photography tradition.\\r\\nhttps://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge\\r\\n\\r\\nRobert \\"Bob\\" Baldridge is a long-time Greenwich resident. For years he has used his camera to document his experiences, along with those of others. His work has appeared in Vogue, The New York Times Magazine and other publications abroad. He's especially drawn to recording the works-in-progress of other artists. He's documenting actor Matt Dillon's philanthropic work centered on a Rwandan doctor in Africa, and he's been documenting the Dalai Lama and his fellow Tibetans in exile in India.\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://www.greenwichtime.com/news/article/Local-photographer-sheds-light-on-the-art-of-4768898.php#photo-5117574\\r\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/robertbaldridgeofficial/\\r\\nhttps://www.lensculture.com/robert-baldridge?modal=project-1467194\\r\\nhttps://gmpphoto.blogspot.com/2021/12/lisl-steiner-in-cerro-muriano-cordoba.html", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-19T14:56:19.217Z"}	\N	146	2	71	1	Robert Baldridge
