799	2024-06-21 14:32:28.368157+02	{"pk": 148, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"sox17\\\\\\">DES LIEUX \\\\u201cBREASTFEEDING FRIENDLY\\\\u201d \\\\u00c0 PORT\\\\u00c9E DE MAIN<br/>Coffee shops, salons de th\\\\u00e9, \\\\u00e9tablissements de petites restaurations, lieux alternatifs,\\\\u2026 affichant une politique explicitement favorable \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019allaitement pourront \\\\u00eatre facilement g\\\\u00e9olocalisables et identifiables.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dgcmo\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://breastfreedom.com/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Breastfreedom.com</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"41e335ce-52fa-476e-a4ee-fee44c20c750\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:48:00Z", "live": true, "path": "000100040005000A", "slug": "breast-freedom", "depth": 4, "owner": 2, "title": "Breast Freedom", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/breast-freedom/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Breast Freedom", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 108, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": 703, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [1], "header_cta_link": "https://breastfreedom.com/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com", "header_cta_text": "Visiter le site de Breast Freedom", "latest_revision": 798, "translation_key": "83a98f28-f386-41fd-841d-1246216cb019", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [{"pk": 95, "page": 148, "category": 1}], "header_cta_label": "breastfreedom.com", "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-06-20T13:52:41.639Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-18T13:49:47.380Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "DES LIEUX “BREASTFEEDING FRIENDLY” À PORTÉE DE MAIN\\r\\nCoffee shops, salons de thé, établissements de petites restaurations, lieux alternatifs,… affichant une politique explicitement favorable à l’allaitement pourront être facilement géolocalisables et identifiables.\\r\\n\\r\\nBreastfreedom.com", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-21T12:32:25.377Z"}	\N	148	2	71	1	Breast Freedom
723	2024-06-20 16:04:58.440186+02	{"pk": 158, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"02w1f\\\\\\">\\\\ud83d\\\\udd25 Afro groove &amp; rock \\\\ud83c\\\\uddf8\\\\ud83c\\\\uddf3\\\\ud83c\\\\udde8\\\\ud83c\\\\uddee\\\\ud83c\\\\uddeb\\\\ud83c\\\\uddf7</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2c3bn\\\\\\">KaceKode vous proposent une musique m\\\\u00e9tiss\\\\u00e9 du S\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9gal, de la C\\\\u00f4te d\\\\u2019Ivoire et de la France pour vous faire danser toute la nuit.\\\\u200b Leur \\\\u00e9nergie authentique et explosive vous fait voyager aux quatre coins du monde avec leur reggae, ska, coup\\\\u00e9 d\\\\u00e9cal\\\\u00e9, afro-rock et afro-groove. Apr\\\\u00e8s la sortie de deux albums, \\\\u00ab Rencontres de voisins \\\\u00bb et \\\\u00ab Exils \\\\u00bb, vous pouvez les retrouvez au Glazart, \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019Alimentation G\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9rale, la Petite Halle de la Villette, Le Lavoir Moderne, festival des Murs \\\\u00e0 P\\\\u00eache, festival Montreuil Paradies, festival Rock the Nation, P\\\\u00e9niche Concorde Atlantique, Bercy Beaucoup, les Amarres ...<br/></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"elbpg\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.facebook.com/KaceKode/about/?ref=page_internal&amp;locale=fr_FR\\\\\\">https://www.facebook.com/KaceKode/about/?ref=page_internal&amp;locale=fr_FR</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.instagram.com/kacekode/?hl=fr&amp;ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.instagram.com/kacekode/?hl=fr</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.youtube.com/@kacekode6435?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.youtube.com/@kacekode6435</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.samusocial.paris/kacekode-un-groupe-qui-fait-du-bien?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://www.samusocial.paris/kacekode-un-groupe-qui-fait-du-bien</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://fr.euronews.com/culture/2017/12/11/-kacekode-riche-de-ses-differences?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://fr.euronews.com/culture/2017/12/11/-kacekode-riche-de-ses-differences</a><br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://kacekode.bandcamp.com/album/exils?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">https://kacekode.bandcamp.com/album/exils</a><br/>Contact Adrien Collet : adrien-collet@hotmail.fr</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"32df1b01-a036-4302-befd-a616e0e998bc\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T14:00:00Z", "live": true, "path": "000100040005000K", "slug": "kacekode", "depth": 4, "owner": 2, "title": "KaceKode", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/kacekode/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "KaceKode", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 118, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": 611, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [1], "header_cta_link": "https://www.facebook.com/KaceKode/about/?ref=page_internal&locale=fr_FR", "header_cta_text": "Voir le site et l'appli", "latest_revision": 722, "translation_key": "6f1d4a4b-c921-443b-9972-4e88011fc3d0", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [{"pk": 85, "page": 158, "category": 1}], "header_cta_label": "facebook.com/KaceKodeR", "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-06-19T14:52:56.696Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-18T14:01:06.644Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "🔥 Afro groove & rock 🇸🇳🇨🇮🇫🇷\\r\\n\\r\\nKaceKode vous proposent une musique métissé du Sénégal, de la Côte d’Ivoire et de la France pour vous faire danser toute la nuit.​ Leur énergie authentique et explosive vous fait voyager aux quatre coins du monde avec leur reggae, ska, coupé décalé, afro-rock et afro-groove. Après la sortie de deux albums, « Rencontres de voisins » et « Exils », vous pouvez les retrouvez au Glazart, à l’Alimentation Générale, la Petite Halle de la Villette, Le Lavoir Moderne, festival des Murs à Pêche, festival Montreuil Paradies, festival Rock the Nation, Péniche Concorde Atlantique, Bercy Beaucoup, les Amarres ...\\r\\n\\r\\nhttps://www.facebook.com/KaceKode/about/?ref=page_internal&locale=fr_FR\\r\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/kacekode/?hl=fr\\r\\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@kacekode6435\\r\\nhttps://www.samusocial.paris/kacekode-un-groupe-qui-fait-du-bien\\r\\nhttps://fr.euronews.com/culture/2017/12/11/-kacekode-riche-de-ses-differences\\r\\nhttps://kacekode.bandcamp.com/album/exils\\r\\nContact Adrien Collet : adrien-collet@hotmail.fr", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-20T14:04:56.064Z"}	\N	158	2	71	1	KaceKode
