published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Artisan d’art, diplômé de l’École Boulle en 1999, Olivier Duhec a passé dix années à se perfectionner dans le travail du métal chez des créateurs parmi les plus prestigieux, dont Jean Perzel qui a beaucoup influencé son travail.\\r\\n \\nDuHec.Art.", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-19T12:31:03.555Z"}	\N	171	1	71	1	Olivier DUHEC, Sculpteur bronzier d'art
550	2024-06-19 14:31:03.85207+02	{"pk": 173, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ukhis\\\\\\">Banya = <b>bain de vapeur</b> russe, dont la temp\\\\u00e9rature et l'hygrom\\\\u00e9trie oscillent entre celles du sauna et celles du hammam.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9s1aq\\\\\\">Le Banya Tour nait de cette pratique traditionnelle du bain d\\\\u00e9plac\\\\u00e9e de la sph\\\\u00e8re intime vers la place publique. Le Tour prend la forme d'une <b>s\\\\u00e9rie de performances</b> qui questionnent le corps dans l'espace public. Chaque performance se r\\\\u00e9invente avec le lieu qui nous accueille, avec les baigneurs.<br/><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.banyatour.fr/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Continuer la lecture</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"2cf0e1ef-1bce-48db-8beb-19bf2a110f11\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:43:00Z", "live": false, "path": "00010003000A00050007", "slug": "banya-tour", "depth": 5, "owner": 2, "title": "Banya Tour", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/banya-tour/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Banya Tour", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 105, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 549, "translation_key": "10e7055e-0b80-420d-9f39-b18d00ce5501", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Banya = bain de vapeur russe, dont la température et l'hygrométrie oscillent entre celles du sauna et celles du hammam.\\r\\n \\nLe Banya Tour nait de cette pratique traditionnelle du bain déplacée de la sphère intime vers la place publique. Le Tour prend la forme d'une série de performances qui questionnent le corps dans l'espace public. Chaque performance se réinvente avec le lieu qui nous accueille, avec les baigneurs.\\r\\nContinuer la lecture", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-19T12:31:03.812Z"}	\N	173	1	71	1	Banya Tour
554	2024-06-19 14:31:04.149552+02	{"pk": 175, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"gqc5e\\\\\\">Denis Decastro</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"du74\\\\\\">Denis de Castro est un chercheur en m\\\\u00e9decine, qui travaillait auparavant, je crois, au CNRS, dans le centre de Paris. Denis vit maintenant \\\\u00e0 Dunedun, en Australie. Avant de prendre sa retraite, Denis traitait des donn\\\\u00e9es volumineuses en langage R et faisait des blagues, apportant de la lumi\\\\u00e8re \\\\u00e0 son \\\\u00e9quipe de recherche. Aujourd'hui, Denis est un contributeur important de Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"87bn5\\\\\\">Denis de Castro is a medical research scientist, previously I think with the CNRS in central Paris. Denis now lives in Dunedun Australia. Prior to retirement, Denis processed big data in R-languages and made jokes, bringing light to his research team. Today, Denis is a significant contributor to Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2e40h\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://auckland.academia.edu/DenisdeCastro?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Academia.edu</a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"32uv4\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.researchgate.net/scientific-contributions/Denis-de-Castro-33850121?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Researchgate</a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5qm44\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://flaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">flaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com</a><br/></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"8knt\\\\\\">Email</li></ul>\\", \\"id\\": \\"2b93b62d-b019-4a9b-a438-ba97546874d0\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:47:00Z", "live": false, "path": "00010003000A00050009", "slug": "bmcp-bio-medical-consulting-paris-also-aukland-and-dunedin", "depth": 5, "owner": 2, "title": "BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)", "locale": 2, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/home-1/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/bmcp-bio-medical-consulting-paris-also-aukland-and-dunedin/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 107, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [], "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 553, "translation_key": "4dc52cb9-7c1c-4a68-adf0-490f07a1e9fb", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Denis Decastro\\r\\n \\nDenis de Castro est un chercheur en médecine, qui travaillait auparavant, je crois, au CNRS, dans le centre de Paris. Denis vit maintenant à Dunedun, en Australie. Avant de prendre sa retraite, Denis traitait des données volumineuses en langage R et faisait des blagues, apportant de la lumière à son équipe de recherche. Aujourd'hui, Denis est un contributeur important de Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.\\r\\n \\nDenis de Castro is a medical research scientist, previously I think with the CNRS in central Paris. Denis now lives in Dunedun Australia. Prior to retirement, Denis processed big data in R-languages and made jokes, bringing light to his research team. Today, Denis is a significant contributor to Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.\\r\\n \\nAcademia.edu\\r\\nResearchgate\\r\\nflaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\r\\nEmail", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-19T12:31:04.108Z"}	\N	175	1	71	1	BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)
