704	2024-06-20 15:55:11.241737+02	{"pk": 149, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"vqswo\\\\\\">Accompagnement de cr\\\\u00e9ateurs et d'artistes</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"42ou0\\\\\\">Sp\\\\u00e9cialis\\\\u00e9s dans les march\\\\u00e9s de l'art et la cr\\\\u00e9ation, nous vous apportons notre vision du monde et notre expertise pour vous aider \\\\u00e0 voir plus loin, plus grand.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3lnrf\\\\\\">A trouver la meilleure version de vous-m\\\\u00eame et les meilleurs march\\\\u00e9s pour vendre et vivre de vos cr\\\\u00e9ations.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"aqqc0\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://lebureauducreateur.fr/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">LeBureauDuCreateur.fr</a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"d1c61fdf-3ff0-4e74-828e-021d3a663803\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:49:00Z", "live": true, "path": "000100040005000B", "slug": "le-bureau-du-créateur", "depth": 4, "owner": 2, "title": "Le Bureau du Créateur", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/le-bureau-du-créateur/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Le Bureau du Créateur", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 109, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": 629, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [1], "header_cta_link": "https://www.lebureauducreateur.fr/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com", "header_cta_text": "Voir le site et l'appli", "latest_revision": 629, "translation_key": "ba1f0597-c89e-42d0-ae66-7bb74d77128d", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [{"pk": 94, "page": 149, "category": 1}], "header_cta_label": "lebureauducreateur.fr", "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-06-19T14:55:29.832Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-18T13:51:43.947Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Accompagnement de créateurs et d'artistes\\r\\nSpécialisés dans les marchés de l'art et la création, nous vous apportons notre vision du monde et notre expertise pour vous aider à voir plus loin, plus grand.\\r\\n\\r\\nA trouver la meilleure version de vous-même et les meilleurs marchés pour vendre et vivre de vos créations.\\r\\n\\r\\nLeBureauDuCreateur.fr", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-19T14:55:29.794Z"}	\N	149	2	71	1	Le Bureau du Créateur
800	2024-06-21 14:34:57.386367+02	{"pk": 147, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"gqc5e\\\\\\">Denis Decastro</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"du74\\\\\\">Denis de Castro est un chercheur en m\\\\u00e9decine, qui travaillait auparavant, je crois, au CNRS, dans le centre de Paris. Denis vit maintenant \\\\u00e0 Dunedun, en Australie. Avant de prendre sa retraite, Denis traitait des donn\\\\u00e9es volumineuses en langage R et faisait des blagues, apportant de la lumi\\\\u00e8re \\\\u00e0 son \\\\u00e9quipe de recherche. Aujourd'hui, Denis est un contributeur important de Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"87bn5\\\\\\">Denis de Castro is a medical research scientist, previously I think with the CNRS in central Paris. Denis now lives in Dunedun Australia. Prior to retirement, Denis processed big data in R-languages and made jokes, bringing light to his research team. Today, Denis is a significant contributor to Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2e40h\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://auckland.academia.edu/DenisdeCastro?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Academia.edu</a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"32uv4\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://www.researchgate.net/scientific-contributions/Denis-de-Castro-33850121?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">Researchgate</a></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5qm44\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://flaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com/?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\">flaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com</a><br/></li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"8knt\\\\\\">Email</li></ul>\\", \\"id\\": \\"2b93b62d-b019-4a9b-a438-ba97546874d0\\"}]", "date": "2024-06-18T13:47:00Z", "live": true, "path": "0001000400050009", "slug": "bmcp-bio-medical-consulting-paris-also-aukland-and-dunedin", "depth": 4, "owner": 2, "title": "BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "authors": [], "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/annuaire/bmcp-bio-medical-consulting-paris-also-aukland-and-dunedin/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "entry_tags": [], "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)", "content_type": 71, "header_image": 107, "header_large": false, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": 700, "show_in_menus": true, "blog_categories": [3], "header_cta_link": "https://auckland.academia.edu/DenisdeCastro?ref=blog.lesgrandsvoisins.com", "header_cta_text": "Voir le site BMCP - Bio - Medical Consulting Paris", "latest_revision": 700, "translation_key": "4dc52cb9-7c1c-4a68-adf0-490f07a1e9fb", "contentpage_tags": [], "entry_categories": [{"pk": 96, "page": 147, "category": 3}], "header_cta_label": "auckland.academia.edu", "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-06-20T13:48:02.832Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-18T13:48:45.030Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Denis Decastro\\r\\n\\r\\nDenis de Castro est un chercheur en médecine, qui travaillait auparavant, je crois, au CNRS, dans le centre de Paris. Denis vit maintenant à Dunedun, en Australie. Avant de prendre sa retraite, Denis traitait des données volumineuses en langage R et faisait des blagues, apportant de la lumière à son équipe de recherche. Aujourd'hui, Denis est un contributeur important de Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.\\r\\n\\r\\nDenis de Castro is a medical research scientist, previously I think with the CNRS in central Paris. Denis now lives in Dunedun Australia. Prior to retirement, Denis processed big data in R-languages and made jokes, bringing light to his research team. Today, Denis is a significant contributor to Les Grands Voisins A Good Village.\\r\\n\\r\\nAcademia.edu\\r\\nResearchgate\\r\\nflaxbush.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\r\\nEmail", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-20T13:48:02.810Z"}	\N	147	2	71	1	BMCP - Bio-Medical Consulting Paris (also Aukland and Dunedin)
