erzel qui a beaucoup influencé son travail.\\r\\n\\r\\nDuHec.Art.", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-19T14:54:38.899Z"}	\N	152	2	71	1	Olivier DUHEC
