2040	2024-10-21 10:43:05.49706+02	{"pk": 532, "body": "[]", "live": true, "path": "00010007", "slug": "gvcoop", "depth": 2, "owner": 1, "title": "GV.coop : Les Grands Voisins", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "sections": "[]", "url_path": "/gvcoop/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "GV.coop : Les Grands Voisins", "content_type": 87, "header_image": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": 2039, "show_in_menus": false, "section_1_body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<h2 data-block-key=\\\\\\"5m263\\\\\\">GV.coop</h2><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"93nmv\\\\\\">Ca y est, il faut se mettre sur un nom de domaine, car il y avait un truc qui d\\\\u00e9conne avec <a href=\\\\\\"https://www.lesgrandsvoisins.com\\\\\\"><b>lesgrandsvoisins.com</b></a>. Donc, on va utiliser gv.coop. Les identifiants seront sous la forme suivante :</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7fbdh\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://key.gv.coop\\\\\\"><b><i>votreidentifiant</i></b><b>@gv.coop</b></a></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"beql9\\\\\\">Pour retrouver ce nom dans Google, il suffit de d'indiquer gv.coop.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9t5tm\\\\\\">-=\\\\u00bb <a href=\\\\\\"https://key.gv.coop\\\\\\"><b>Cr\\\\u00e9er votre compte ici</b></a><b>. \\\\u00ab=- (lien en bas du formulaire)</b></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"etr3i\\\\\\"><a href=\\\\\\"https://key.gv.coop/realms/master/protocol/openid-connect/logout?client_id=account-console\\\\\\"><b>D\\\\u00e9connexion</b></a></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"945bd6bb-cde0-4543-af41-c76fb1f16bff\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"e19v9\\\\\\">A faire :</p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"c7egq\\\\\\">Mettre en place base d'utilisateurs sur <a href=\\\\\\"https://key.gv.coop\\\\\\">key.gv.coop</a> FAIT</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"3pja1\\\\\\">Cr\\\\u00e9ation de <a href=\\\\\\"https://key.gv.coop\\\\\\">link.gv.coop</a> FAIT (TESTS BETA)</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"a1e9a\\\\\\">Migrer hedgedoc \\\\u00e0 <a href=\\\\\\"https://hedgedoc.gv.coop\\\\\\">hedgedoc.gv.coop</a> FAIT</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"6ln1g\\\\\\">Migrer \\\\u00e0 <a href=\\\\\\"https://vikunja.gv.coop\\\\\\">vikunja.gv.coop</a> FAIT</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"ft19i\\\\\\">Migrer les comptes utilisateurs sur <i>identifiant</i>@gv.coop sur <a href=\\\\\\"https://mail.gv.coop\\\\\\">mail.gv.coop</a> EN COURS (CREATION DE COMPTE ET ENVOI OK, RECEPTION KO) </li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"edu14\\\\\\">Migrer le site principal sur gv.coop depuis www.village.ngo et www.village.ong</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"hn4t\\\\\\">Faire un keycloak \\\\u00e0 key.lesgrandsvoisins.com</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"ac1f7\\\\\\">Migrer mail.lesgrandsvoisins.com \\\\u00e0 mail.gv.coop</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"3ug8d\\\\\\">Fusionner lesgrandsvoisins.com et village.ong en gv.coop</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"2eb67\\\\\\">Remettre en place discourse.gv.coop</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"33t5g\\\\\\">Faire faire un logo Les Grands Voisins : GV.ccop</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"cn7ju\\\\\\">Mettre en place drive.gv.coop</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"48vlh\\\\\\">Faire contribution.gv.coop</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"5td54\\\\\\">Blogging plateform GV.coop ?</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"fu9l7\\\\\\">Page Home GV.coop</li></ol><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"77p8b\\\\\\">Choses inutiles finalement :</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"46a3\\\\\\">Impl\\\\u00e9menter PWM pour <a href=\\\\\\"http://ldap.gv.coop\\\\\\">ldap.gv.coop</a> EN ESSAI</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6bvrm\\\\\\">Impl\\\\u00e9menter une gestion d'utilisateurs et tableau de bord sur <a href=\\\\\\"https://login.gv.coop\\\\\\">login.gv.coop</a> EN ESSAI</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"05112cf4-8712-4be8-a8a3-d9f18d2a7862\\"}]", "section_2_body": "[]", "section_3_body": "[]", "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 2039, "translation_key": "9daa54a8-854b-4904-a0d5-246aa2a8eb78", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-10-20T09:51:17.059Z", "first_published_at": "2024-10-15T11:22:43.878Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "GV.coop Le nom de domaine gv.coop met en valeur notre statut d'association coopérative d'intérêt général. Au contraire des coopératives habituelles, […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-10-20T09:51:17.033Z", "section_2_description_rich": ""}	\N	532	3	87	1	GV.coop : Les Grands Voisins
