1656	2024-07-14 11:11:54.031586+02	{"pk": 444, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"fwa7v\\\\\\">Ce sont les outils qui nous permettent de partager les choses et faire ensemble.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"47c91a5b-8df4-4b8d-894e-8c896d37119f\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "00010004000A0002", "slug": "collaboration", "depth": 4, "owner": 1, "title": "Collaborer", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/apps/collaboration/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Collaborer", "content_type": 89, "header_image": null, "header_large": false, "header_darken": false, "live_revision": 974, "show_in_menus": true, "posts_per_page": 10, "header_cta_link": null, "header_cta_text": null, "latest_revision": 1654, "translation_key": "f5006060-21df-4b8f-96f9-3fa3488eba91", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": null, "header_with_title": false, "last_published_at": "2024-07-14T09:05:40.190Z", "first_published_at": "2024-06-29T06:29:58.871Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Ce sont les outils qui nous permettent de partager les choses et faire ensemble. […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-06-29T07:05:06.708Z"}	\N	444	1	89	1	Collaborer
2008	2024-10-12 10:26:50.987351+02	{"pk": 530, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraph\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"w81df\\\\\\">Bienvenue \\\\u00e0 une rencontre conviviale du 24e Conseil des Grands Voisins \\\\u00e0 la MVAC 14</p><ul><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"p5k5\\\\\\">Formuaire <a linktype=\\\\\\"page\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\"531\\\\\\">d'inscription ici</a> </li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"b1jjq\\\\\\">Pour ajouter \\\\u00e0 votre agenda : <a linktype=\\\\\\"document\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\"5\\\\\\">24e Conseil dans votre agenda (.ics)</a></li></ul><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"a3285\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6n7cp\\\\\\">Maison de la vie associative et citoyenne<br/>76, rue Dagu\\\\u00e8rre<br/>75015 PARIS</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8e09v\\\\\\">et en ligne</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"er971\\\\\\">https://meet.resdigita.com</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"5hoc4\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d75a6\\\\\\">Nous allons voir nos efforts en cours pour nos activit\\\\u00e9s propres -- civisme, arts plastiques, num\\\\u00e9rique -- et voir comment se construit notre village compl\\\\u00e9mentaire.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ba7qm\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"ateun\\\\\\">En plus de nos d\\\\u00e9cisions pass\\\\u00e9es \\\\u00e0 suivre -- prix Annette Monod pour excellence en travail sociale, etc. -- je vous propose de prendre d\\\\u00e9cisions sur les trois sujets suivants :</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"3j48m\\\\\\"></p><ol><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"3rtcl\\\\\\">Peut-\\\\u00eatre tendre vers une identit\\\\u00e9 internet permettant aux autres de nous retrouver plus facilement.</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"fv11t\\\\\\">Ouvrir une deuxi\\\\u00e8me journ\\\\u00e9e de permanence le mercredi soir, vendredi soir ou samedi en journ\\\\u00e9e.</li><li data-block-key=\\\\\\"80f64\\\\\\">Soumettre un projet de quartier populaire avec la Cantine le Monde Bouge et/ou juste comme cela.</li></ol><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6nr6c\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9nr5k\\\\\\">Par ailleurs, nos bases de revenus sont \\\\u00e0 poser. Je pense pouvoir vous poser des forts \\\\u00e9l\\\\u00e9ments de r\\\\u00e9flexion.</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"81gfe\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"1kav0\\\\\\">Merci de venir nombreux !</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8m2m2\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8tth0\\\\\\">Chris</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"dqo0v\\\\\\">chris@lesgrandsvoisins.com</p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"2eajs\\\\\\">+33 7 81 811 811</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"243ea1d5-9564-4a95-8e96-388b6149badf\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "00010004000200040005", "slug": "24e-conseil", "depth": 5, "owner": 1, "title": "24e Conseil mardi 15 oct. 18h30 des Grands Voisins", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 1, "url_path": "/le-village-des-grands-voisins/association/conseils-des-voisins/24e-conseil/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "24e Conseil mardi 15 oct. 18h30 des Grands Voisins", "content_type": 25, "header_image": 183, "header_large": true, "header_darken": true, "live_revision": 2007, "show_in_menus": true, "header_cta_link": "https://www.village.ong/fr/association/conseils-des-voisins/24e-conseil/inscription/", "header_cta_text": "Cliquez ici", "latest_revision": 2007, "translation_key": "76ba5a50-45bc-4baa-b26e-e9bf4cef33f2", "contentpage_tags": [], "header_cta_label": "pour vous inscrire au 24e Conseil ce mar. 15 oct de 18h30 à 20h", "header_with_title": true, "last_published_at": "2024-10-12T08:14:58.739Z", "first_published_at": "2024-10-12T08:07:57.185Z", "header_color_class": null, "search_description": "Bienvenue à une rencontre conviviale du 24e Conseil des Grands Voisins à la MVAC 14 Maison de la vie associative […]", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2024-10-12T08:14:58.697Z"}	\N	530	1	25	1	24e Conseil mardi 15 oct. 18h30 des Grands Voisins
